;;; measure-laws.scm -- Chapter 1 of the measure notes (Thayer, Construction of
;;; Measures, Sec. 3-4): the elementary laws of a countably additive measure.
;;; Agent M-1 of the October roadmap (docs/roadmap-2026-10-03.md, line (b),
;;; decision 4).  Helper prefix mlw-.  25 theorems, every one `modulo 0'.
;;;
;;; THE SETTING.  Everything is stated over the PREDICATE IS-MEASURE(omega, cA, mu)
;;; (structure-library/measure.scm), not over a MEASURE-SPACE s: the five
;;; supports this file proves were stated that way, and MEASURE-SPACE's law is
;;; IS-MEASURE(PTS s, SIGMA s, MEAS s) as a literal conjunct, so each theorem
;;; applies to a structure by one instantiation.
;;;
;;; SURVEY (what the extended-real layer gives; written before the proofs).
;;;  * A measure takes values in RR-POS-STAR = [0, +inf] and countable additivity
;;;    is, as in the notes (Def. 1.15, eq. (6)), an equation over a SEQUENCE
;;;    f_ in FUN(NN, cA) of pairwise disjoint sets:
;;;        mu(BIG-UNION n_ NN (f_ n_)) = ESUM(VNB-LAMBDA n_ NN (mu (f_ n_))).
;;;    mu(EMPTY-SET) = 0 is a conjunct of the definition (notes eq. (5)), so the
;;;    deliverable `measure-empty' is the definition itself and is not restated.
;;;  * ESUM (structure-library/extended-sum.scm) is the UNORDERED sum: the ESUP
;;;    of all finite partial sums FINSUM(RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID, f, S), S a finite
;;;    subset of DOM f.  It is not a series and has no order on the index set.
;;;    Its laws in the tree were esum-in / esum-upper / esum-least (the sup
;;;    characterisation) and the finiteness dichotomy -- nothing about sums over
;;;    NN, nothing termwise, no finite-support evaluation.  Part (A) below adds
;;;    exactly what the measure laws need:
;;;        rps-prefix-zero / -succ / -type   the prefix sums P(n) = sum over
;;;                                          ORD-SEGMENT(n), and their recursion
;;;        rps-finsum-mono-set               more summands, larger sum
;;;        esum-nn-prefix-le                 P(n) <= ESUM f
;;;        esum-nn-le-of-prefixes            all P(n) <= b  =>  ESUM f <= b
;;;                                          (so over NN, ESUM = sup of the prefix sums)
;;;        rps-prefix-le-termwise,
;;;        esum-nn-le-termwise               ESUM is monotone in the summands
;;;        esum-nn-two-support               a, b, 0, 0, ... sums to a + b
;;;  * ESUP / EINF over subsets of RR-POS-STAR exist with their three laws each
;;;    (rake-esup-defined, limsup-tests); EPLUS has its monoid and order laws
;;;    (rake-extended-order).  There is NO subtraction on RR-POS-STAR: the
;;;    subtractive law and continuity from above are stated and proven with the
;;;    real `-', after the finite values are brought into RR
;;;    (rr-pos-star-le-real-in-rr, eplus-real-defined).
;;;
;;; THE THEOREMS.
;;;  (A) the ESUM bricks above.
;;;  (B) measure-finitely-additive   (support; Rudin 1.19(b)) -- countable
;;;                                   additivity at the padded family
;;;                                   k |-> IF(k = 0, a, IF(k = succ 0, b, EMPTY-SET))
;;;      measure-monotone            (support; Rudin 1.19(c))
;;;  (C) bu-seg-zero, bu-seg-succ, sigma-algebra-seg-union-in: the finite union
;;;      A_0 u ... u A_{k-1}, written BIG-UNION uj_ (ORD-SEGMENT k) (f uj_), and
;;;      its measurability.  THE DISJOINTIFICATION is the lambda
;;;          B = VNB-LAMBDA bk_ NN (COMPLEMENT-IN (f bk_) (BIG-UNION uj_ (ORD-SEGMENT bk_) (f uj_)))
;;;      -- no NN-recursion is needed: the finite union is a BIG-UNION over a
;;;      segment, and its measurability is an induction (sigma-algebra-seg-union-in).
;;;      disjointify-type, -disjoint, -union (same union, by the least index:
;;;      nn-least-element), -prefix (the n-th prefix sum of mu(B_k) is
;;;      mu(A_0 u ... u A_{n-1})).
;;;      measure-countably-subadditive (support; the notes use it unnumbered in
;;;                                   Prop. 2.9): mu(U A) = mu(U B) = ESUM mu(B) <= ESUM mu(A).
;;;      nondecreasing-seg-subset, measure-continuity-from-below (support;
;;;                                   Prop. 1.17, stated as the supremum, eq. (7)).
;;;      measure-finite-subset, measure-subtractive (a subset b, mu(b) finite =>
;;;                                   mu(b \ a) = mu(b) - mu(a); used unnumbered in
;;;                                   the proof of Prop. 1.18).
;;;      measure-continuity-from-above (support; Prop. 1.18, eq. (9)), by the
;;;                                   notes' route: C_n = A_0 \ A_n is
;;;                                   nondecreasing with union A_0 \ I; the
;;;                                   infimum is NOT obtained by moving "sup" past
;;;                                   a subtraction (no such law exists for
;;;                                   ESUP/EINF): both inequalities of the inf are
;;;                                   proven, the hard one through the real bound
;;;                                   mu(A_0) - inf.
;;;  (D) measure-pushforward (Prop. 1.19): for a measurable f, the function
;;;      B |-> mu({x in omega : f(x) in B}) on cB is a countably additive measure.
;;;
;;; WHERE THE STRUCTURES SAY IT DIFFERENTLY FROM THE NOTES.
;;;  * Countable intersection has no binder: continuity from above is stated
;;;    (as the support was) with omega \ U_n (omega \ A_n), and the finiteness
;;;    hypothesis is on the term of index 0.
;;;  * "sup" and "inf" are ESUP / EINF of the IMAGE of the sequence of measures.
;;;  * The preimage in (D) is the SEP form IS-MEASURABLE-MAP uses, not the
;;;    PREIMAGE head (which reads a structure's PTS).
;;;
;;; LOAD WINDOW [3381, 3564) in load.scm line numbers: lo is forced by EINF's
;;; laws (einf-in, einf-lower, einf-greatest: theorem-library/limsup-tests,
;;; line 3380), which only measure-continuity-from-above cites; everything else
;;; is at or below line 1731 (nn-least-element).  hi: nothing in the tree cites
;;; these names; keep it before pss-topics (3564).  Suggested slot: immediately
;;; after "theorem-library/limsup-tests".
;;;
;;; RETIRE, after wiring: structure-library/measure.scm, the five supports
;;; (support + warrant! + topic! + gloss! each): measure-monotone (:332),
;;; measure-finitely-additive (:347), measure-countably-subadditive (:364),
;;; measure-continuity-from-below (:384), measure-continuity-from-above (:409).
;;; ====================================================================

;;; =====================================================================
;;; (0) file-local kit.  Prefix mlw-.
;;; =====================================================================


(define mlw-m 'RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID)
(define (mlw-fs f s) (list 'FINSUM 'RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID f s))
(define (mlw-seg n) (list 'ORD-SEGMENT n))

;;; (OPR M) == eplus, (IDEN M) == 0, (CARR M) == RR-POS-STAR, read off through
;;; surface-goal! (the sanctioned door; no accessor macete fired by name).
(define (mlw-readoff! eqn)
  (dk-have! eqn
    (lambda ()
      (quietly (lambda () (surface-goal! 'RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID)))
      (qrfl))))
(define mlw-opr-eq  '(== (OPR RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID) eplus))
(define mlw-iden-eq '(== (IDEN RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID) 0))
(define mlw-carr-eq '(== (CARR RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID) RR-POS-STAR))


;;; forall z_ in ORD-SEGMENT(k). f(z_) in CARR(M), from f in FUN(NN, RR-POS-STAR)
;;; and k in NN in context.
(define (mlw-ptwise-claim fv sv)
  (list 'FORALL 'z_ (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'z_ sv)
                          (list 'IN (list fv 'z_) '(CARR RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID)))))
(define (mlw-ptwise-seg! fv kv)
  (dk-have! (mlw-ptwise-claim fv (mlw-seg kv))
    (lambda ()
      (let ((zv (dk-di-var!)))
        (mlw-readoff! mlw-carr-eq)
        (subst mlw-carr-eq)
        (dk-fact! 'ord-segment-nn-subset kv zv)
        (fact 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN 'RR-POS-STAR zv)
        (ass)))))


;;; (IN t RR-POS-STAR) from (IN t (CARR M)) in context.
(define (mlw-type-rps! tm)
  (dk-have! (list 'IN tm 'RR-POS-STAR)
    (lambda ()
      (mlw-readoff! mlw-carr-eq)
      (subst '(= RR-POS-STAR (CARR RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID)))
      (ass))))

;;; (IN (eplus x y) RR-POS-STAR), both summands typed in context.
(define (mlw-eplus-typed! x y)
  (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'IN x 'RR-POS-STAR) (list 'IN y 'RR-POS-STAR))
            (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
  (fact 'eplus-closed x y))

;;; =====================================================================
;;; (A) Prefix sums of a sequence in [0, +inf].
;;; =====================================================================

;;; rps-prefix-zero: the empty prefix sums to 0.
(sp (make-wff '(FORALL f (= (FINSUM RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID f (ORD-SEGMENT 0)) 0))))
(di)
(let ((fv (caddr (cadr (dk-goal)))))
  (fact 'ord-segment-zero)
  (subst '(= (ORD-SEGMENT 0) EMPTY-SET))
  (fact 'finsum-empty mlw-m fv)
  (subst (list '== (mlw-fs fv 'EMPTY-SET) '(IDEN RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID)))
  (mlw-readoff! mlw-iden-eq)
  (subst mlw-iden-eq)
  (rfl))
(qed 'rps-prefix-zero)
(topic! 'rps-prefix-zero 'analysis)


;;; rps-prefix-succ: P(succ n) = P(n) + f(n).
(sp (make-wff '(FORALL f (IMPLIES (IN f (FUN NN RR-POS-STAR))
                 (FORALL n (IMPLIES (IN n NN)
                   (= (FINSUM RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID f (ORD-SEGMENT (succ n)))
                      (eplus (FINSUM RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID f (ORD-SEGMENT n)) (f n)))))))))
(dk-peel!)
(let* ((gl  (dk-goal))
       (fv  (caddr (cadr gl)))
       (nv  (cadr (caddr (caddr gl))))
       (osn (mlw-seg nv))
       (oss (mlw-seg (list 'succ nv)))
       (un  (list 'UNION osn (list 'PAIR nv nv))))
  (dk-fact! 'nn-succ-closed nv)
  (dk-fact! 'nn-subset-ord nv)
  (dk-fact! 'membership-implies-sethood nv 'NN)
  (dk-fact! 'ord-segment-is-set nv)
  (dk-fact! 'card-segment nv)
  (dk-have! (list 'IN (list 'CARD osn) 'NN)
         (lambda () (subst (list '= (list 'CARD osn) nv)) (ass)))
  (dk-fact! 'ord-segment-self nv)
  (dk-fact! 'ord-segment-insert nv)
  (ta 'rr-pos-star-is-comm-monoid)
  (mlw-ptwise-seg! fv (list 'succ nv))
  (mlw-ptwise-seg! fv nv)
  (fact 'finsum-comm-monoid-type-ptwise mlw-m osn fv)
  (dk-fact! 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN 'RR-POS-STAR nv)
  (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'z_ (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'z_ un)
                                   (list 'IN (list fv 'z_) '(CARR RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID))))
    (lambda () (subst (list '= un oss)) (ass)))
  (fact 'finsum-cm-insert-ptwise mlw-m osn nv fv)
  (subst (list '= oss un))
  (subst (list '= (mlw-fs fv un) (list '(OPR RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID) (mlw-fs fv osn) (list fv nv))))
  (mlw-readoff! mlw-opr-eq)
  (subst mlw-opr-eq)
  (mlw-type-rps! (mlw-fs fv osn))
  (mlw-eplus-typed! (mlw-fs fv osn) (list fv nv))
  (rfl))
(qed 'rps-prefix-succ)
(topic! 'rps-prefix-succ 'analysis)

;;; rps-finsum-mono-set: over a finite T, a [0,+inf]-valued family sums to at
;;; least as much on T as on any subset S of T.
(sp (make-wff '(FORALL f (FORALL S (FORALL T
   (IMPLIES (IN T SET)
    (IMPLIES (IN (CARD T) NN)
     (IMPLIES (SUBSET S T)
      (IMPLIES (FORALL z_ (IMPLIES (IN z_ T) (IN (f z_) RR-POS-STAR)))
        (<= (FINSUM RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID f S) (FINSUM RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID f T)))))))))))
(dk-peel!)
(let* ((gl  (dk-goal))
       (fv  (caddr (cadr gl)))
       (sv  (cadddr (cadr gl)))
       (tv  (cadddr (caddr gl)))
       (dv  (list 'COMPLEMENT-IN tv sv))
       (un  (list 'UNION sv dv))
       (ptT (list 'FORALL 'z_ (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'z_ tv) (list 'IN (list fv 'z_) 'RR-POS-STAR))))
       (fs  (mlw-fs fv sv))
       (fd  (mlw-fs fv dv)))
  (ta 'rr-pos-star-is-comm-monoid)
  (mlw-readoff! mlw-carr-eq)
  ;; S and D = T \ S are finite sets
  (fact 'subclass-of-set-is-set sv tv)
  (fact 'complement-in-set-closure tv sv)
  (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'z (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'z sv) (list 'IN 'z tv)))
    (lambda () (let ((zv (dk-di-var!))) (fact 'subset-mem-fwd sv tv zv) (ass))))
  (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'z (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'z dv) (list 'IN 'z tv)))
    (lambda () (let ((zv (dk-di-var!)))
                 (mac-h 'complement-in-membership (list 'IN zv dv))
                 (dk-split-all!) (ass))))
  (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'IN tv 'SET) (list 'IN (list 'CARD tv) 'NN))
            (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
  (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'IN sv 'SET) (list 'FORALL 'z (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'z sv) (list 'IN 'z tv))))
            (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
  (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'IN dv 'SET) (list 'FORALL 'z (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'z dv) (list 'IN 'z tv))))
            (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
  (fact 'card-subset-nn tv sv)
  (fact 'card-subset-nn tv dv)
  ;; pointwise typings in CARR M on S, D and S u D
  (for-each
    (lambda (xv)
      (dk-have! (mlw-ptwise-claim fv xv)
        (lambda ()
          (let ((zv (dk-di-var!)))
            (subst mlw-carr-eq)
            (inst+ (list 'FORALL 'z (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'z xv) (list 'IN 'z tv))) zv)
            (inst+ ptT zv)
            (ass)))))
    (list sv dv))
  (fact 'union-complement-in sv tv)             ; T = S u D
  (dk-have! (mlw-ptwise-claim fv un)
    (lambda () (subst (list '= un tv))
               (let ((zv (dk-di-var!)))
                 (subst mlw-carr-eq) (inst+ ptT zv) (ass))))
  (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'z_ (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'z_ dv) (list 'NOT (list 'IN 'z_ sv))))
    (lambda () (let ((zv (dk-di-var!)))
                 (mac-h 'complement-in-membership (list 'IN zv dv))
                 (dk-split-all!) (ass))))
  (fact 'finsum-cm-union-disjoint mlw-m sv dv fv)
  (fact 'finsum-comm-monoid-type-ptwise mlw-m sv fv)
  (fact 'finsum-comm-monoid-type-ptwise mlw-m dv fv)
  (mlw-type-rps! fs)
  (mlw-type-rps! fd)
  (subst (list '= tv un))
  (subst (list '= (mlw-fs fv un) (list '(OPR RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID) fs fd)))
  (mlw-readoff! mlw-opr-eq)
  (subst mlw-opr-eq)
  (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'IN fs 'RR-POS-STAR) (list 'IN fd 'RR-POS-STAR))
            (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
  (fact 'eplus-le-left fs fd)
  (ass))
(qed 'rps-finsum-mono-set)
(topic! 'rps-finsum-mono-set 'analysis)

;;; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
;;; DOM f = NN and f in FUN(DOM f, RR-POS-STAR), for f in FUN(NN, RR-POS-STAR):
;;; the shape ESUM's three laws are guarded on.
(define (mlw-dom! fv)
  (fact 'nn-is-set)
  (dk-project! (list 'IN fv '(FUN NN)) 'fun-codomain-iff (list 'IN fv '(FUN NN RR-POS-STAR)))
  (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'IN fv '(FUN NN)) '(IN NN SET))
            (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
  (fact 'dom-of-fun 'NN fv)
  (dk-split-all! (list (dk-ctx-form (list 'AND (list 'IN (list 'DOM fv) 'SET)
                                          (list '= (list 'DOM fv) 'NN)))))
  (dk-have! (list 'IN fv (list 'FUN (list 'DOM fv) 'RR-POS-STAR))
            (lambda () (subst (list '= (list 'DOM fv) 'NN)) (ass))))

;;; esum-nn-prefix-le: every prefix sum is below the sum.
(sp (make-wff '(FORALL f (IMPLIES (IN f (FUN NN RR-POS-STAR))
                 (FORALL n (IMPLIES (IN n NN)
                   (<= (FINSUM RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID f (ORD-SEGMENT n)) (ESUM f))))))))
(dk-peel!)
(let* ((gl  (dk-goal))
       (fv  (caddr (cadr gl)))
       (nv  (cadr (cadddr (cadr gl))))
       (osn (mlw-seg nv)))
  (mlw-dom! fv)
  (dk-fact! 'nn-subset-ord nv)
  (dk-fact! 'ord-segment-is-set nv)
  (dk-fact! 'card-segment nv)
  (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'IN osn 'SET)
                  (list 'AND (list 'IN (list 'CARD osn) 'NN) (list 'SUBSET osn (list 'DOM fv))))
    (lambda ()
      (dk-conj-close!
        (lambda ()
          (let ((g (dk-goal)))
            (cond ((equal? g (list 'IN osn 'SET)) (ass))
                  ((equal? g (list 'IN (list 'CARD osn) 'NN))
                   (subst (list '= (list 'CARD osn) nv)) (ass))
                  (#t (subst (list '= (list 'DOM fv) 'NN))
                      (mac 'subset-def)
                      (let ((zv (dk-di-var!)))
                        (dk-fact! 'ord-segment-nn-subset nv zv)
                        (ass)))))))))
  (fact 'esum-upper fv osn)
  (ass))
(qed 'esum-nn-prefix-le)
(topic! 'esum-nn-prefix-le 'analysis)

;;; esum-nn-le-of-prefixes: a bound on every prefix sum bounds the sum.
(sp (make-wff '(FORALL f (IMPLIES (IN f (FUN NN RR-POS-STAR))
                 (FORALL b (IMPLIES (IN b RR-POS-STAR)
                   (IMPLIES (FORALL n (IMPLIES (IN n NN)
                              (<= (FINSUM RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID f (ORD-SEGMENT n)) b)))
                     (<= (ESUM f) b))))))))
(dk-peel!)
(let* ((gl  (dk-goal))
       (fv  (cadr (cadr gl)))
       (bv  (caddr gl))
       (pb  (dk-pick (dk-head? 'FORALL) "the prefix bound"))
       (dm  (list 'DOM fv))
       (claim (list 'FORALL 'S
                    (list 'IMPLIES (list 'AND '(IN S SET) (list 'AND '(IN (CARD S) NN) (list 'SUBSET 'S dm)))
                          (list '<= (mlw-fs fv 'S) bv)))))
  (mlw-dom! fv)
  (dk-have! claim
    (lambda ()
      (di)
      (let* ((sv (cadr (cadr (cadr (dk-goal)))))
             (fin (dk-landed-1 (lambda () (di)))))
        (dk-split-all! (list fin))
        (dk-have! (list 'SUBSET sv 'NN)
          (lambda ()
            (mac 'subset-def)
            (let ((zv (dk-di-var!)))
              (fact 'subset-mem-fwd sv dm zv)
              (subst (list '= 'NN dm))
              (ass))))
        (fact 'nn-finite-subset-bounded sv)
        (let* ((ex (dk-pick (dk-head? 'FORSOME) "the bound"))
               (nb (dk-skolem! ex))
               (bnd (dk-pick (lambda (f) (and (eq? (car f) 'FORALL)
                                              (dk-contains? f (list 'IN 'y sv))))
                             "the bound clause")))
          (dk-split-all!)
          (let ((osn (mlw-seg nb)))
            (dk-fact! 'nn-subset-ord nb)
            (dk-fact! 'ord-segment-is-set nb)
            (dk-fact! 'card-segment nb)
            (dk-have! (list 'IN (list 'CARD osn) 'NN)
                      (lambda () (subst (list '= (list 'CARD osn) nb)) (ass)))
            (dk-have! (list 'SUBSET sv osn)
              (lambda ()
                (mac 'subset-def)
                (let ((zv (dk-di-var!)))
                  (fact 'subset-mem-fwd sv 'NN zv)
                  (dk-have! (list 'NOT (list '<= nb zv))
                    (lambda ()
                      (di)
                      (inst+ bnd zv)
                      (let ((ng (dk-ctx-form (list 'NOT (list 'IN zv sv)))))
                        (ai ng))))
                  (fact 'nn-in-rr nb)
                  (fact 'nn-in-rr zv)
                  (fact 'rr-not-le-lt nb zv)
                  (fact 'seg-mem-lt nb zv)
                  (mac 'seg-mem-lt)
                  (ass))))
            (mlw-ptwise-seg! fv nb)
            (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'z_ (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'z_ osn) (list 'IN (list fv 'z_) 'RR-POS-STAR)))
              (lambda () (let ((zv (dk-di-var!)))
                           (dk-fact! 'ord-segment-nn-subset nb zv)
                           (fact 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN 'RR-POS-STAR zv)
                           (ass))))
            (fact 'rps-finsum-mono-set fv sv osn)
            (inst+ pb nb)
            (ta 'rr-pos-star-is-comm-monoid)
            (fact 'subclass-of-set-is-set sv osn)
            (dk-have! (mlw-ptwise-claim fv sv)
              (lambda () (let ((zv (dk-di-var!)))
                           (fact 'subset-mem-fwd sv osn zv)
                           (dk-fact! 'ord-segment-nn-subset nb zv)
                           (mlw-readoff! mlw-carr-eq) (subst mlw-carr-eq)
                           (fact 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN 'RR-POS-STAR zv)
                           (ass))))
            (fact 'finsum-comm-monoid-type-ptwise mlw-m sv fv)
            (mlw-ptwise-seg! fv nb)
            (fact 'finsum-comm-monoid-type-ptwise mlw-m osn fv)
            (mlw-type-rps! (mlw-fs fv sv))
            (mlw-type-rps! (mlw-fs fv osn))
            (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'IN (mlw-fs fv sv) 'RR-POS-STAR)
                            (list 'AND (list 'IN (mlw-fs fv osn) 'RR-POS-STAR) (list 'IN bv 'RR-POS-STAR)))
                      (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
            (dk-have! (list 'AND (list '<= (mlw-fs fv sv) (mlw-fs fv osn)) (list '<= (mlw-fs fv osn) bv))
                      (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
            (fact 'rr-pos-star-le-trans (mlw-fs fv sv) (mlw-fs fv osn) bv)
            (ass))))))
  (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'IN bv 'RR-POS-STAR) claim)
            (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
  (fact 'esum-least fv bv)
  (ass))
(qed 'esum-nn-le-of-prefixes)
(topic! 'esum-nn-le-of-prefixes 'analysis)

;;; rps-prefix-type: every prefix sum lies in [0, +inf].
(sp (make-wff '(FORALL f (IMPLIES (IN f (FUN NN RR-POS-STAR))
                 (FORALL n (IMPLIES (IN n NN)
                   (IN (FINSUM RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID f (ORD-SEGMENT n)) RR-POS-STAR)))))))
(dk-peel!)
(let* ((gl (dk-goal))
       (fv (caddr (cadr gl)))
       (nv (cadr (cadddr (cadr gl)))))
  (fact 'nn-subset-ord nv)
  (fact 'ord-segment-is-set nv)
  (fact 'card-segment nv)
  (dk-have! (list 'IN (list 'CARD (mlw-seg nv)) 'NN)
            (lambda () (subst (list '= (list 'CARD (mlw-seg nv)) nv)) (ass)))
  (ta 'rr-pos-star-is-comm-monoid)
  (mlw-ptwise-seg! fv nv)
  (fact 'finsum-comm-monoid-type-ptwise mlw-m (mlw-seg nv) fv)
  (mlw-type-rps! (mlw-fs fv (mlw-seg nv)))
  (ass))
(qed 'rps-prefix-type)
(topic! 'rps-prefix-type 'analysis)

;;; rps-prefix-le-termwise: termwise <= gives prefixwise <=.  Induction on n,
;;; stated with n outermost (ni wants it there).
(sp (make-wff '(FORALL n (IMPLIES (IN n NN)
   (FORALL f (FORALL g (IMPLIES (IN f (FUN NN RR-POS-STAR))
     (IMPLIES (IN g (FUN NN RR-POS-STAR))
       (IMPLIES (FORALL k (IMPLIES (IN k NN) (<= (f k) (g k))))
         (<= (FINSUM RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID f (ORD-SEGMENT n))
             (FINSUM RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID g (ORD-SEGMENT n))))))))))))
;;; the step-leaf idiom: di lands (IN n NN), di lands the IH, dk-peel! the rest.
(define (mlw-step-open!)
  (let* ((landed (dk-landed (lambda () (di))))
         (nin (find-first (lambda (f) (and (pair? f) (eq? (car f) 'IN) (eq? (caddr f) 'NN))) landed))
         (ih  (dk-landed-1 (lambda () (di)))))
    (dk-peel!)
    (list (cadr nin) ih)))
(define (mlw-base-leaf? l) (dk-contains? (dk-goal-of l) '(ORD-SEGMENT 0)))

(define (mlw-le-refl! x)
  (fact 'rr-pos-star-le-refl x)
  (ass))

(let ((legs (dk-opened (lambda () (ni)))))
  (for-each
    (lambda (l)
      (dk-focus! l)
      (if (mlw-base-leaf? l)
          (begin
            (dk-peel!)
            (let* ((gl (dk-goal)) (fv (caddr (cadr gl))) (gv (caddr (caddr gl))))
              (fact 'rps-prefix-zero fv)
              (fact 'rps-prefix-zero gv)
              (subst (list '= (mlw-fs fv (mlw-seg 0)) 0))
              (subst (list '= (mlw-fs gv (mlw-seg 0)) 0))
              (fact 'zero-in-rr-pos-star)
              (mlw-le-refl! 0)))
          (let* ((r  (mlw-step-open!))
                 (nv (car r)) (ih (cadr r))
                 (gl (dk-goal)) (fv (caddr (cadr gl))) (gv (caddr (caddr gl)))
                 (pf (mlw-fs fv (mlw-seg nv))) (pg (mlw-fs gv (mlw-seg nv)))
                 (hk (dk-pick (lambda (f) (and (eq? (car f) 'FORALL) (dk-contains? f '<=)
                                               (not (dk-contains? f 'FINSUM))))
                              "the termwise bound")))
            (fact 'rps-prefix-succ fv nv)
            (fact 'rps-prefix-succ gv nv)
            (subst (list '= (mlw-fs fv (mlw-seg (list 'succ nv))) (list 'eplus pf (list fv nv))))
            (subst (list '= (mlw-fs gv (mlw-seg (list 'succ nv))) (list 'eplus pg (list gv nv))))
            (fact 'rps-prefix-type fv nv)
            (fact 'rps-prefix-type gv nv)
            (fact 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN 'RR-POS-STAR nv)
            (fact 'fun-apply-type-c gv 'NN 'RR-POS-STAR nv)
            (dk-apply! ih fv gv)
            (dk-apply! hk nv)
            (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'IN pf 'RR-POS-STAR)
                            (list 'AND (list 'IN (list fv nv) 'RR-POS-STAR)
                                  (list 'AND (list 'IN pg 'RR-POS-STAR) (list 'IN (list gv nv) 'RR-POS-STAR))))
                      (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
            (dk-have! (list 'AND (list '<= pf pg) (list '<= (list fv nv) (list gv nv)))
                      (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
            (fact 'eplus-mono pf (list fv nv) pg (list gv nv))
            (ass))))
    legs))
(qed 'rps-prefix-le-termwise)
(topic! 'rps-prefix-le-termwise 'analysis)

;;; esum-nn-le-termwise: ESUM is monotone in the summands.
(sp (make-wff '(FORALL f (FORALL g (IMPLIES (IN f (FUN NN RR-POS-STAR))
                 (IMPLIES (IN g (FUN NN RR-POS-STAR))
                   (IMPLIES (FORALL k (IMPLIES (IN k NN) (<= (f k) (g k))))
                     (<= (ESUM f) (ESUM g)))))))))
(dk-peel!)
(let* ((gl (dk-goal)) (fv (cadr (cadr gl))) (gv (cadr (caddr gl))))
  (mlw-dom! gv)
  (fact 'esum-in gv)
  (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'n (list 'IMPLIES '(IN n NN)
                    (list '<= (mlw-fs fv '(ORD-SEGMENT n)) (list 'ESUM gv))))
    (lambda ()
      (let ((nv (dk-di-var!)))
        (fact 'rps-prefix-le-termwise nv fv gv)
        (fact 'esum-nn-prefix-le gv nv)
        (fact 'rps-prefix-type fv nv)
        (fact 'rps-prefix-type gv nv)
        (let ((pf (mlw-fs fv (mlw-seg nv))) (pg (mlw-fs gv (mlw-seg nv))))
          (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'IN pf 'RR-POS-STAR)
                          (list 'AND (list 'IN pg 'RR-POS-STAR) (list 'IN (list 'ESUM gv) 'RR-POS-STAR)))
                    (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
          (dk-have! (list 'AND (list '<= pf pg) (list '<= pg (list 'ESUM gv)))
                    (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
          (fact 'rr-pos-star-le-trans pf pg (list 'ESUM gv))
          (ass)))))
  (fact 'esum-nn-le-of-prefixes fv (list 'ESUM gv))
  (ass))
(qed 'esum-nn-le-termwise)
(topic! 'esum-nn-le-termwise 'analysis)

;;; esum-nn-two-support: a sequence in [0,+inf] that vanishes from index 2 on
;;; sums to its first two terms.  This is what "countable additivity gives
;;; finite additivity" is: the padded sequence a, b, 0, 0, ...
(sp (make-wff '(FORALL h (IMPLIES (IN h (FUN NN RR-POS-STAR))
                 (IMPLIES (FORALL q (IMPLIES (IN q NN) (= (h (succ (succ q))) 0)))
                   (= (ESUM h) (eplus (h 0) (h (succ 0)))))))))
(dk-peel!)
(let* ((gl  (dk-goal))
       (hv  (cadr (cadr gl)))
       (zq  (dk-pick (lambda (f) (and (eq? (car f) 'FORALL) (dk-contains? f 'succ))) "the tail"))
       (h0  (list hv 0))
       (s0  '(succ 0))
       (ss0 '(succ (succ 0)))
       (h1  (list hv s0))
       (cv  (list 'eplus h0 h1))
       (P   (lambda (n) (mlw-fs hv (mlw-seg n)))))
  (mlw-dom! hv)
  (fact 'nn-zero-in)
  (fact 'nn-succ-closed 0)
  (fact 'nn-succ-closed s0)
  (fact 'fun-apply-type-c hv 'NN 'RR-POS-STAR 0)
  (fact 'fun-apply-type-c hv 'NN 'RR-POS-STAR s0)
  (mlw-eplus-typed! h0 h1)
  ;; P(2) = c
  (fact 'rps-prefix-zero hv)
  (fact 'rps-prefix-succ hv 0)
  (fact 'rps-prefix-succ hv s0)
  (fact 'eplus-zero-left h0)
  (dk-have! (list '= (P ss0) cv)
    (lambda ()
      (subst (list '= (P ss0) (list 'eplus (P s0) h1)))
      (subst (list '= (P s0) (list 'eplus (P 0) h0)))
      (subst (list '= (P 0) 0))
      (subst (list '= (list 'eplus 0 h0) h0))
      (rfl)))
  ;; P(succ succ q) = c for every q
  (let ((stable (list 'FORALL 'q (list 'IMPLIES '(IN q NN) (list '= (P '(succ (succ q))) cv)))))
    (dk-have! stable
      (lambda ()
        (for-each
          (lambda (l)
            (dk-focus! l)
            (if (not (dk-contains? (dk-goal) 'IMPLIES))
                (ass)
                (let* ((r (mlw-step-open!)) (qv (car r)) (ih (cadr r))
                       (sq (list 'succ qv)) (ssq (list 'succ sq)))
                  (fact 'nn-succ-closed qv)
                  (fact 'nn-succ-closed sq)
                  (fact 'rps-prefix-succ hv ssq)
                  (dk-apply! zq qv)
                  (fact 'eplus-zero-right cv)
                  (subst (list '= (P (list 'succ ssq)) (list 'eplus (P ssq) (list hv ssq))))
                  (subst ih)
                  (subst (list '= (list hv ssq) 0))
                  (subst (list '= (list 'eplus cv 0) cv))
                  (rfl))))
          (dk-opened (lambda () (ni))))))
    ;; c <= ESUM h
    (fact 'esum-nn-prefix-le hv ss0)
    (dk-have! (list '<= cv (list 'ESUM hv))
              (lambda () (subst (list '= cv (P ss0))) (ass)))
    ;; ESUM h <= c
    (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'n (list 'IMPLIES '(IN n NN) (list '<= (P 'n) cv)))
      (lambda ()
        (let* ((nv (dk-di-var!))
               (orf (dk-fact! 'nn-zero-or-succ nv)))
          (for-each
            (lambda (l)
              (dk-focus! l)
              (if (dk-asm? (list '= nv 0))
                  (begin
                    (subst (list '= nv 0))
                    (subst (list '= (P 0) 0))
                    (fact 'rr-pos-star-nonneg cv)
                    (ass))
                  (let* ((ex (dk-pick (dk-head? 'FORSOME) "n = succ q"))
                         (qv (dk-skolem! ex)))
                    (dk-split-all!)
                    (subst (list '= nv (list 'succ qv)))
                    (let ((orq (dk-fact! 'nn-zero-or-succ qv)))
                      (for-each
                        (lambda (m)
                          (dk-focus! m)
                          (if (dk-asm? (list '= qv 0))
                              (begin
                                (subst (list '= qv 0))
                                (subst (list '= (P s0) (list 'eplus (P 0) h0)))
                                (subst (list '= (P 0) 0))
                                (subst (list '= (list 'eplus 0 h0) h0))
                                (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'IN h0 'RR-POS-STAR) (list 'IN h1 'RR-POS-STAR))
                                          (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
                                (fact 'eplus-le-left h0 h1)
                                (ass))
                              (let* ((ex2 (dk-pick (dk-head? 'FORSOME) "q = succ r"))
                                     (rv (dk-skolem! ex2)))
                                (dk-split-all!)
                                (subst (list '= qv (list 'succ rv)))
                                (inst+ stable rv)
                                (subst (list '= (P (list 'succ (list 'succ rv))) cv))
                                (mlw-le-refl! cv))))
                        (dk-opened (lambda () (ai orq))))))))
            (dk-opened (lambda () (ai orf)))))))
    (fact 'esum-nn-le-of-prefixes hv cv)
    (fact 'esum-in hv)
    (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'IN (list 'ESUM hv) 'RR-POS-STAR) (list 'IN cv 'RR-POS-STAR))
              (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
    (dk-have! (list 'AND (list '<= (list 'ESUM hv) cv) (list '<= cv (list 'ESUM hv)))
              (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
    (fact 'rr-pos-star-le-antisymm (list 'ESUM hv) cv)
    (ass)))
(qed 'esum-nn-two-support)
(topic! 'esum-nn-two-support 'analysis)

;;; =====================================================================
;;; (B) The measure laws.
;;; =====================================================================

;;; the four conjuncts of IS-MEASURE(om, ca, mu), landed (the hypothesis kept).
(define (mlw-measure-parts! om ca mu)
  (let* ((iff (dk-fact! 'is-measure om ca mu))
         (rhs (caddr iff))
         (c1 (cadr rhs)) (c2 (cadr (caddr rhs)))
         (c3 (cadr (caddr (caddr rhs)))) (c4 (caddr (caddr (caddr rhs)))))
    (map (lambda (c) (dk-project! c 'IS-MEASURE (list 'IS-MEASURE om ca mu)))
         (list c1 c2 c3 c4))))

;;; the first IF subterm, outermost first
(define (mlw-find-if x)
  (cond ((not (pair? x)) #f)
        ((eq? (car x) 'IF) x)
        (#t (let loop ((xs x))
              (cond ((null? xs) #f)
                    ((not (pair? xs)) #f)
                    ((mlw-find-if (car xs)) => (lambda (r) r))
                    (#t (loop (cdr xs))))))))

;;; resolve an IF by its condition without touching the goal (copy of
;;; rake-measure2's r6f-if-eq!): returns the equation (= IF val), in context.
(define (mlw-if-eq! true? ifterm closer)
  (let* ((c      (cadr ifterm))
         (val    (if true? (caddr ifterm) (cadddr ifterm)))
         (want   (if true? c (list 'NOT c)))
         (opened (dk-opened (lambda () (if true? (if-true ifterm) (if-false ifterm)))))
         (conds  (filter (lambda (l) (alpha-equiv? (dk-goal-of l) want)) opened))
         (mains  (filter (lambda (l) (not (memq l conds))) opened)))
    (if (not (and (<= (length conds) 1) (= 1 (length mains))))
        (error "mlw-if-eq!: expected one condition leaf and one main leaf, got"
               (map (lambda (l) (expression->string (dk-goal-of l))) opened)))
    (if (pair? conds) (begin (dk-focus! (car conds)) (closer)))
    (dk-focus! (car mains))
    (list '= ifterm val)))

;;; (REL lhs val) from (REL lhs IFTERM) and the equation (= IFTERM val)
(define (mlw-transfer! eqn rel lhs)
  (let ((val (caddr eqn)) (ifterm (cadr eqn)))
    (dk-have! (list rel lhs val)
              (lambda () (subst (list '= val ifterm)) (ass)))))

;;; NOT(succ(succ q) = succ 0) and NOT(succ(succ q) = 0)
(define (mlw-ssq-facts! qv)
  (let ((sq (list 'succ qv)))
    (fact 'nn-succ-closed qv)
    (fact 'nn-succ-closed sq)
    (fact 'nn-zero-in)
    (fact 'nn-succ-nonzero sq)
    (fact 'nn-succ-nonzero qv)
    (dk-have! (list 'NOT (list '= (list 'succ sq) '(succ 0)))
      (lambda ()
        (di)
        (fact 'nn-succ-inj sq 0)
        (ai (list 'NOT (list '= sq 0)))))))

(define mlw-fam '(VNB-LAMBDA mk_ NN (IF (= mk_ 0) a_ (IF (= mk_ (succ 0)) b_ EMPTY-SET))))

;;; (= (INTERSECTION X Y) EMPTY-SET) by class extensionality; NOGO is a
;;; procedure of the element w that lands, in the lane, (NOT (IN w X)) or
;;; (NOT (IN w Y)) as the case may be.
(define (mlw-inter-empty! x y nogo)
  (let ((ix (list 'INTERSECTION x y)))
    (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'w_ (list 'IFF (list 'IN 'w_ ix) (list 'IN 'w_ 'EMPTY-SET)))
      (lambda ()
        (let ((w (dk-di-var! (lambda (g) (cadr (cadr g))))))
          (fact 'empty-set-has-no-members w)
          (let ((keepers (nogo w)))
            (mac 'intersection-membership)
            (apply dk-only! (cons (list 'NOT (list 'IN w 'EMPTY-SET)) keepers))
            (prop)))))
    (fact 'class-extensionality ix 'EMPTY-SET)
    (ass)))


;;; the rest of measure-finitely-additive, given the countable-additivity
;;; equation at the padded family G:  (= (mu BU) (ESUM h)).
(define (mlw-fa-finish! g cadd-g m0)
  (let* ((bu   (cadr (cadr cadd-g)))
         (hl   (cadr (caddr cadd-g)))
         (s0   '(succ 0))
         (uab  '(UNION a_ b_)))
    ;; BU = a u b
    (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'w_ (list 'IFF (list 'IN 'w_ bu) (list 'IN 'w_ uab)))
      (lambda ()
        (let ((w (dk-di-var! (lambda (gl) (cadr (cadr gl))))))
          (for-each
            (lambda (l)
              (dk-focus! l)
              (if (equal? (dk-goal) (list 'IN w uab))
                  ;; w in BU => w in a u b
                  (let* ((landed (dk-landed (lambda () (bu-me (list 'IN w bu)))))
                         (ein (find-first (lambda (f) (and (eq? (car f) 'IN) (eq? (caddr f) 'NN))) landed))
                         (ev  (cadr ein))
                         (app (find-first (lambda (f) (not (eq? f ein))) landed)))
                    (dk-lam-b-h! app)
                    (let ((ife (dk-pick (lambda (f) (and (eq? (car f) 'IN) (eq? (cadr f) w)
                                                         (pair? (caddr f)) (eq? (car (caddr f)) 'IF)))
                                        "w in IF")))
                      (mac 'union-membership)
                      (let ((ift (caddr ife)))
                        (use-em (cadr ift)
                          (lambda ()
                            (mlw-transfer! (mlw-if-eq! #t ift dk-ass!) 'IN w)
                            (oi-l) (ass))
                          (lambda ()
                            (let* ((e1 (mlw-if-eq! #f ift dk-ass!))
                                   (ift2 (caddr e1)))
                              (mlw-transfer! e1 'IN w)
                              (use-em (cadr ift2)
                                (lambda ()
                                  (mlw-transfer! (mlw-if-eq! #t ift2 dk-ass!) 'IN w)
                                  (oi-r) (ass))
                                (lambda ()
                                  (mlw-transfer! (mlw-if-eq! #f ift2 dk-ass!) 'IN w)
                                  (fact 'empty-set-has-no-members w)
                                  (ai (list 'NOT (list 'IN w 'EMPTY-SET)))))))))))
                  ;; w in a u b => w in BU
                  (let ((orf (dk-landed-1 (lambda () (mac-h 'union-membership (list 'IN w uab))))))
                    (for-each
                      (lambda (m)
                        (dk-focus! m)
                        (let* ((a-side (dk-asm? (list 'IN w 'a_)))
                               (k (if a-side 0 s0)))
                          (for-each
                            (lambda (n)
                              (dk-focus! n)
                              (if (equal? (dk-goal) (list 'IN k 'NN))
                                  (ass)
                                  (begin
                                    (dk-lam-b!)
                                    (if a-side
                                        (dk-if-branch! #t (mlw-find-if (dk-goal)) (lambda () (rfl))
                                                       dk-ass!)
                                        (dk-if-branch! #f (mlw-find-if (dk-goal)) #f
                                          (lambda ()
                                            (dk-if-branch! #t (mlw-find-if (dk-goal)) (lambda () (rfl))
                                                           dk-ass!)))))))
                            (dk-opened (lambda () (bu-mi k))))))
                      (dk-opened (lambda () (ai orf)))))))
            (dk-opened (lambda () (di)))))))
    (fact 'class-extensionality bu uab)
    ;; h = n |-> mu(g n): typed, and its values
    (dk-have! (list 'IN hl '(FUN NN RR-POS-STAR))
      (lambda ()
        (dk-lam-t!)
        (dk-peel!)
        (let ((kv (cadr (cadr (cadr (dk-goal))))))
          (dk-fact! 'fun-apply-type-c g 'NN 'cA kv)
          (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR (list g kv))
          (ass))))
    (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'q (list 'IMPLIES '(IN q NN) (list '= (list hl '(succ (succ q))) 0)))
      (lambda ()
        (let ((qv (dk-di-var!)))
          (mlw-ssq-facts! qv)
          (dk-lam-b!)
          (dk-if-branch! #f (mlw-find-if (dk-goal)) #f
            (lambda ()
              (dk-if-branch! #f (mlw-find-if (dk-goal)) #f
                dk-ass!))))))
    (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR 'a_)
    (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR 'b_)
    (dk-have! (list '= (list hl 0) '(mu a_))
      (lambda ()
        (dk-lam-b!)
        (dk-if-branch! #t (mlw-find-if (dk-goal)) (lambda () (rfl)) (lambda () (rfl)))))
    (dk-have! (list '= (list hl s0) '(mu b_))
      (lambda ()
        (dk-lam-b!)
        (dk-if-branch! #f (mlw-find-if (dk-goal)) #f
          (lambda ()
            (dk-if-branch! #t (mlw-find-if (dk-goal)) (lambda () (rfl)) (lambda () (rfl)))))))
    (fact 'esum-nn-two-support hl)
    (subst (list '= uab bu))
    (subst cadd-g)
    (subst (list '= (list 'ESUM hl) (list 'eplus (list hl 0) (list hl s0))))
    (subst (list '= (list hl 0) '(mu a_)))
    (subst (list '= (list hl s0) '(mu b_)))
    (mlw-eplus-typed! '(mu a_) '(mu b_))
    (rfl)))

(sp (make-wff (forall-guarded '(omega cA mu a_ b_)
                  '((IS-MEASURE omega cA mu)
                    (IN a_ cA)
                    (IN b_ cA)
                    (= (INTERSECTION a_ b_) EMPTY-SET))
    '(= (mu (UNION a_ b_)) (eplus (mu a_) (mu b_))))))
(dk-peel!)
(let* ((parts (mlw-measure-parts! 'omega 'cA 'mu))
       (sig (car parts)) (mfun (cadr parts)) (m0 (caddr parts)) (cadd (cadddr parts))
       (g mlw-fam)
       (s0 '(succ 0)))
  (fact 'sigma-algebra-empty-in 'omega 'cA)
  (fact 'nn-zero-in)
  (fact 'nn-succ-closed 0)
  (fact 'nn-succ-nonzero 0)
  ;; g in FUN(NN, cA)
  (dk-have! (list 'IN g '(FUN NN cA))
    (lambda ()
      (dk-lam-t!)
      (dk-peel!)
      (let ((ift (mlw-find-if (dk-goal))))
        (dk-case-if! ift
          (lambda (t1 v1)
            (if t1 (ass)
                (dk-case-if! (mlw-find-if (dk-goal)) (lambda (t2 v2) (ass)))))))))
  ;; the padded family is pairwise disjoint
  (let* ((landed (dk-landed (lambda () (inst+ cadd g))))
         (ch (find-first (lambda (f) (and (eq? (car f) 'IMPLIES) (pair? (cadr f))
                                          (eq? (car (cadr f)) 'FORALL)))
                         landed))
         (no-ab (lambda (w)
                  (let ((nab (list 'NOT (list 'IN w '(INTERSECTION a_ b_)))))
                    (dk-have! nab (lambda () (subst '(= (INTERSECTION a_ b_) EMPTY-SET)) (ass)))
                    (list nab (dk-fact! 'intersection-membership 'a_ 'b_ w)))))
         (no-e (lambda (w) '()))
         (cadd-g
          (detach-with! ch
            (lambda ()
              (dk-peel!)
              (let* ((gl (dk-goal))
                     (iv (cadr (cadr (cadr gl))))
                     (jv (cadr (caddr (cadr gl))))
                     (contra (lambda (c)
                               (dk-have! (list '= iv jv)
                                 (lambda () (subst (list '= iv c)) (subst (list '= jv c)) (rfl)))
                               (ai (list 'NOT (list '= iv jv))))))
                ;; type both IF terms (instantiating at an untyped IF owes its
                ;; definedness): (g i) in cA, then beta in the hypothesis
                (for-each (lambda (v)
                            (let ((ty (dk-fact! 'fun-apply-type-c g 'NN 'cA v)))
                              (dk-lam-b-h! ty)))
                          (list iv jv))
                (dk-lam-b!)
                (dk-case-if! (mlw-find-if (dk-goal))
                  (lambda (ti vi)
                    (if ti
                        ;; i = 0
                        (dk-case-if! (mlw-find-if (dk-goal))
                          (lambda (tj vj)
                            (if tj (contra 0)
                                (dk-case-if! (mlw-find-if (dk-goal))
                                  (lambda (tj2 vj2)
                                    (if tj2 (ass)
                                        (mlw-inter-empty! 'a_ 'EMPTY-SET no-e)))))))
                        (dk-case-if! (mlw-find-if (dk-goal))
                          (lambda (ti2 vi2)
                            (if ti2
                                ;; i = 1
                                (dk-case-if! (mlw-find-if (dk-goal))
                                  (lambda (tj vj)
                                    (if tj (mlw-inter-empty! 'b_ 'a_ no-ab)
                                        (dk-case-if! (mlw-find-if (dk-goal))
                                          (lambda (tj2 vj2)
                                            (if tj2 (contra '(succ 0))
                                                (mlw-inter-empty! 'b_ 'EMPTY-SET no-e)))))))
                                (mlw-inter-empty! 'EMPTY-SET (caddr (cadr (dk-goal))) no-e)))))))
                )))))
    (mlw-fa-finish! g cadd-g m0)))
(qed 'measure-finitely-additive)
(topic! 'measure-finitely-additive 'plumbing)

;;; measure-monotone: b = a u (b \ a), disjoint, so mu(b) = mu(a) + mu(b \ a).
(sp (make-wff (forall-guarded '(omega cA mu a_ b_)
                  '((IS-MEASURE omega cA mu)
                    (IN a_ cA)
                    (IN b_ cA)
                    (SUBSET a_ b_))
    '(<= (mu a_) (mu b_)))))
(dk-peel!)
(let* ((parts (mlw-measure-parts! 'omega 'cA 'mu))
       (dv '(COMPLEMENT-IN b_ a_))
       (ud (list 'UNION 'a_ dv)))
  (fact 'sigma-algebra-difference-closed 'omega 'cA 'b_ 'a_)
  (fact 'union-complement-in 'a_ 'b_)
  (fact 'intersection-complement-in-empty 'a_ 'b_)
  (fact 'measure-finitely-additive 'omega 'cA 'mu 'a_ dv)
  (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR 'a_)
  (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR dv)
  (subst (list '= 'b_ ud))
  (subst (list '= (list 'mu ud) (list 'eplus '(mu a_) (list 'mu dv))))
  (dk-have! (list 'AND '(IN (mu a_) RR-POS-STAR) (list 'IN (list 'mu dv) 'RR-POS-STAR))
            (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
  (fact 'eplus-le-left '(mu a_) (list 'mu dv))
  (ass))
(qed 'measure-monotone)
(topic! 'measure-monotone 'inequalities)

;;; =====================================================================
;;; (C) Finite unions over an initial segment, and the disjointification
;;;     B_k = A_k \ (A_0 u ... u A_{k-1}).
;;; =====================================================================

;;; bu-me on (IN w BU): returns (index-membership . body-membership)
(define (mlw-bu-open! w bu)
  (let* ((landed (dk-landed (lambda () (bu-me (list 'IN w bu)))))
         (ein (find-first (lambda (f) (and (eq? (car f) 'IN) (not (equal? (cadr f) w)))) landed))
         (app (find-first (lambda (f) (not (eq? f ein))) landed)))
    (cons ein app)))

;;; bu-seg-zero: the union over the empty segment is empty.
(sp (make-wff '(FORALL f (= (BIG-UNION uj_ (ORD-SEGMENT 0) (f uj_)) EMPTY-SET))))
(di)
(let* ((bu (cadr (dk-goal))))
  (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'w_ (list 'IFF (list 'IN 'w_ bu) '(IN w_ EMPTY-SET)))
    (lambda ()
      (let ((w (dk-di-var! (lambda (gl) (cadr (cadr gl))))))
        (for-each
          (lambda (l)
            (dk-focus! l)
            (if (equal? (dk-goal) (list 'IN w 'EMPTY-SET))
                (let* ((r (mlw-bu-open! w bu)) (ev (cadr (car r))))
                  (fact 'ord-segment-zero-no-members ev)
                  (ai (list 'NOT (car r))))
                (begin
                  (fact 'empty-set-has-no-members w)
                  (ai (list 'NOT (list 'IN w 'EMPTY-SET))))))
          (dk-opened (lambda () (di)))))))
  (fact 'class-extensionality bu 'EMPTY-SET)
  (ass))
(qed 'bu-seg-zero)
(topic! 'bu-seg-zero 'set-quotient)

;;; (e in seg(succ k)) <-> (e in seg k or e = k): land the direction wanted.
(define (mlw-seg-succ-fwd! kv ev)   ; from (IN e seg(succ k)) land the OR
  (let* ((iff (dk-fact! 'ord-segment-nn-succ kv ev))
         (a (cadr iff)) (b (caddr iff)))
    (ai iff)
    (detach! (list 'IMPLIES a b))
    b))
(define (mlw-seg-succ-bwd! kv ev disj-thunk)   ; prove (IN e seg(succ k)) via the OR
  (let* ((iff (dk-fact! 'ord-segment-nn-succ kv ev))
         (a (cadr iff)) (b (caddr iff)))
    (dk-have! b disj-thunk)
    (ai iff)
    (detach! (list 'IMPLIES b a))
    (ass)))

;;; bu-seg-succ: the union over seg(succ k) adds the k-th term.
(sp (make-wff '(FORALL k (IMPLIES (IN k NN)
   (FORALL C (FORALL f (IMPLIES (IN f (FUN NN C))
     (= (BIG-UNION uj_ (ORD-SEGMENT (succ k)) (f uj_))
        (UNION (BIG-UNION uj_ (ORD-SEGMENT k) (f uj_)) (f k))))))))))
(dk-peel!)
(let* ((gl (dk-goal))
       (lhs (cadr gl)) (rhs (caddr gl))
       (bk (cadr rhs)) (fk (caddr rhs))
       (fv (car fk)) (kv (cadr fk)))
  (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'w_ (list 'IFF (list 'IN 'w_ lhs) (list 'IN 'w_ rhs)))
    (lambda ()
      (let ((w (dk-di-var! (lambda (g) (cadr (cadr g))))))
        (for-each
          (lambda (l)
            (dk-focus! l)
            (if (equal? (dk-goal) (list 'IN w rhs))
                (let* ((r (mlw-bu-open! w lhs)) (ev (cadr (car r)))
                       (orf (mlw-seg-succ-fwd! kv ev)))
                  (mac 'union-membership)
                  (for-each
                    (lambda (m)
                      (dk-focus! m)
                      (if (dk-asm? (list '= ev kv))
                          (begin (oi-r) (subst (list '= kv ev)) (ass))
                          (begin (oi-l)
                                 (for-each (lambda (n) (dk-focus! n) (ass))
                                           (dk-opened (lambda () (bu-mi ev)))))))
                    (dk-opened (lambda () (ai orf)))))
                (let ((orf (dk-landed-1 (lambda () (mac-h 'union-membership (list 'IN w rhs))))))
                  (for-each
                    (lambda (m)
                      (dk-focus! m)
                      (if (dk-asm? (list 'IN w bk))
                          (let* ((r (mlw-bu-open! w bk)) (ev (cadr (car r))))
                            (for-each (lambda (n)
                                        (dk-focus! n)
                                        (if (equal? (dk-goal) (list 'IN ev (mlw-seg (list 'succ kv))))
                                            (mlw-seg-succ-bwd! kv ev (lambda () (oi-l) (ass)))
                                            (ass)))
                                      (dk-opened (lambda () (bu-mi ev)))))
                          (for-each (lambda (n)
                                      (dk-focus! n)
                                      (if (equal? (dk-goal) (list 'IN kv (mlw-seg (list 'succ kv))))
                                          (mlw-seg-succ-bwd! kv kv (lambda () (oi-r) (rfl)))
                                          (ass)))
                                    (dk-opened (lambda () (bu-mi kv))))))
                    (dk-opened (lambda () (ai orf)))))))
          (dk-opened (lambda () (di)))))))
  (fact 'class-extensionality lhs rhs)
  (ass))
(qed 'bu-seg-succ)
(topic! 'bu-seg-succ 'set-quotient)

;;; sigma-algebra-seg-union-in: A_0 u ... u A_{k-1} is measurable.
(sp (make-wff '(FORALL k (IMPLIES (IN k NN)
   (FORALL omega (FORALL cA (FORALL f
     (IMPLIES (IS-SIGMA-ALGEBRA omega cA)
       (IMPLIES (IN f (FUN NN cA))
         (IN (BIG-UNION uj_ (ORD-SEGMENT k) (f uj_)) cA))))))))))
(for-each
  (lambda (l)
    (dk-focus! l)
    (if (mlw-base-leaf? l)
        (begin
          (dk-peel!)
          (let* ((gl (dk-goal)) (bu (cadr gl)) (fv (car (cadddr bu))))
            (fact 'bu-seg-zero fv)
            (subst (list '= bu 'EMPTY-SET))
            (fact 'sigma-algebra-empty-in 'omega 'cA)
            (ass)))
        (let* ((r (mlw-step-open!)) (kv (car r)) (ih (cadr r))
               (gl (dk-goal)) (bu (cadr gl)) (fv (car (cadddr bu)))
               (bk (list 'BIG-UNION (cadr bu) (mlw-seg kv) (cadddr bu))))
          (fact 'bu-seg-succ kv 'cA fv)
          (subst (list '= bu (list 'UNION bk (list fv kv))))
          (dk-apply! ih 'omega 'cA fv)
          (fact 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN 'cA kv)
          (fact 'sigma-algebra-union-closed-2 'omega 'cA bk (list fv kv))
          (ass))))
  (dk-opened (lambda () (ni))))
(qed 'sigma-algebra-seg-union-in)
(topic! 'sigma-algebra-seg-union-in 'set-quotient)

;;; the disjointified family of f: k |-> f(k) \ (f(0) u ... u f(k-1))
(define (mlw-dsj fv)
  (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'bk_ 'NN
        (list 'COMPLEMENT-IN (list fv 'bk_) (list 'BIG-UNION 'uj_ '(ORD-SEGMENT bk_) (list fv 'uj_)))))
(define (mlw-useg fv kv)
  (list 'BIG-UNION 'uj_ (mlw-seg kv) (list fv 'uj_)))
(define (mlw-bterm fv kv)
  (list 'COMPLEMENT-IN (list fv kv) (mlw-useg fv kv)))

;;; disjointify-type
(sp (make-wff '(FORALL omega (FORALL cA (FORALL f
   (IMPLIES (IS-SIGMA-ALGEBRA omega cA)
     (IMPLIES (IN f (FUN NN cA))
       (IN (VNB-LAMBDA bk_ NN (COMPLEMENT-IN (f bk_) (BIG-UNION uj_ (ORD-SEGMENT bk_) (f uj_))))
           (FUN NN cA)))))))))
(dk-peel!)
(let ((fv (car (cadr (cadddr (cadr (dk-goal)))))))
  (dk-lam-t!)
  (dk-peel!)
  (let* ((gl (dk-goal)) (kv (cadr (cadr (cadr gl)))))
    (fact 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN 'cA kv)
    (fact 'sigma-algebra-seg-union-in kv 'omega 'cA fv)
    (fact 'sigma-algebra-difference-closed 'omega 'cA (list fv kv) (mlw-useg fv kv))
    (ass)))
(qed 'disjointify-type)
(topic! 'disjointify-type 'set-quotient)

;;; for x in seg(y): w in B_x => w in f(x) => w in U_y, and w in B_y => w notin U_y
(define (mlw-disj-keepers! w fv xv yv)
  (let* ((bx (mlw-bterm fv xv)) (by (mlw-bterm fv yv)) (uy (mlw-useg fv yv))
         (k1 (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN w bx) (list 'IN w (list fv xv))))
         (k2 (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN w (list fv xv)) (list 'IN w uy)))
         (k3 (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN w by) (list 'NOT (list 'IN w uy)))))
    (dk-have! k1 (lambda () (di) (mac-h 'complement-in-membership (list 'IN w bx)) (dk-split-all!) (ass)))
    (dk-have! k2 (lambda () (di)
                   (for-each (lambda (n) (dk-focus! n) (ass)) (dk-opened (lambda () (bu-mi xv))))))
    (dk-have! k3 (lambda () (di) (mac-h 'complement-in-membership (list 'IN w by)) (dk-split-all!) (ass)))
    (list k1 k2 k3)))

;;; x < y  gives  x in seg(y)
(define (mlw-lt-seg! xv yv)
  (let* ((iff (dk-fact! 'seg-mem-lt yv xv)))
    (ai iff)
    (detach! (list 'IMPLIES (caddr iff) (cadr iff)))))

;;; disjointify-disjoint
(sp (make-wff '(FORALL f (FORALL C (IMPLIES (IN f (FUN NN C))
   (FORALL i_ (FORALL j_ (IMPLIES (IN i_ NN) (IMPLIES (IN j_ NN) (IMPLIES (NOT (= i_ j_))
     (= (INTERSECTION
          ((VNB-LAMBDA bk_ NN (COMPLEMENT-IN (f bk_) (BIG-UNION uj_ (ORD-SEGMENT bk_) (f uj_)))) i_)
          ((VNB-LAMBDA bk_ NN (COMPLEMENT-IN (f bk_) (BIG-UNION uj_ (ORD-SEGMENT bk_) (f uj_)))) j_))
        EMPTY-SET)))))))))))
(dk-peel!)
(let* ((gl (dk-goal))
       (bi (cadr (cadr gl))) (bj (caddr (cadr gl)))
       (fv (car (cadr (cadddr (car bi)))))
       (iv (cadr bi)) (jv (cadr bj)))
  (dk-lam-b!)
  (use-em (list '< iv jv)
    (lambda ()
      (mlw-lt-seg! iv jv)
      (mlw-inter-empty! (mlw-bterm fv iv) (mlw-bterm fv jv)
                        (lambda (w) (mlw-disj-keepers! w fv iv jv))))
    (lambda ()
      (use-em (list '< jv iv)
        (lambda ()
          (mlw-lt-seg! jv iv)
          (mlw-inter-empty! (mlw-bterm fv iv) (mlw-bterm fv jv)
                            (lambda (w) (mlw-disj-keepers! w fv jv iv))))
        (lambda ()
          (fact 'nn-not-lt-le iv jv)
          (fact 'nn-not-lt-le jv iv)
          (fact 'nn-le-antisym iv jv)
          (ai (list 'NOT (list '= iv jv))))))))
(qed 'disjointify-disjoint)
(topic! 'disjointify-disjoint 'set-quotient)

;;; (< j m) and (<= m j) with j, m in NN: close the focus (any goal) by
;;; refuting m < m.
(define (mlw-nn-clash! jv mv)
  (fact 'nn-in-rr jv)
  (fact 'nn-in-rr mv)
  (dk-have! (list '< mv mv)
            (lambda () (dk-ineq! (list 'IN jv 'RR) (list 'IN mv 'RR)
                                 (list '< jv mv) (list '<= mv jv))))
  (fact 'rr-lt-irrefl mv)
  (ai (list 'NOT (list '< mv mv))))

;;; disjointify-union: the disjointified family has the same union.
(sp (make-wff '(FORALL f (FORALL C (IMPLIES (IN f (FUN NN C))
   (= (BIG-UNION n_ NN
        ((VNB-LAMBDA bk_ NN (COMPLEMENT-IN (f bk_) (BIG-UNION uj_ (ORD-SEGMENT bk_) (f uj_)))) n_))
      (BIG-UNION n_ NN (f n_))))))))
(dk-peel!)
(let* ((gl (dk-goal)) (lhs (cadr gl)) (rhs (caddr gl))
       (fv (car (cadddr rhs))))
  (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'w_ (list 'IFF (list 'IN 'w_ lhs) (list 'IN 'w_ rhs)))
    (lambda ()
      (let ((w (dk-di-var! (lambda (g) (cadr (cadr g))))))
        (for-each
          (lambda (l)
            (dk-focus! l)
            (if (equal? (dk-goal) (list 'IN w rhs))
                ;; B_e is inside f(e)
                (let* ((r (mlw-bu-open! w lhs)) (ev (cadr (car r))))
                  (dk-lam-b-h! (cdr r))
                  (mac-h 'complement-in-membership (list 'IN w (mlw-bterm fv ev)))
                  (dk-split-all!)
                  (for-each (lambda (n) (dk-focus! n) (ass)) (dk-opened (lambda () (bu-mi ev)))))
                ;; w in f(e): the least such index m puts w in B_m
                (let* ((r (mlw-bu-open! w rhs)) (ev (cadr (car r)))
                       (tt (list 'SEP 'tm_ 'NN (list 'IN w (list fv 'tm_)))))
                  (dk-have! (list 'SUBSET tt 'NN)
                    (lambda () (mac 'subset-def)
                               (let ((zv (dk-di-var!))) (sep-me (list 'IN zv tt)) (ass))))
                  (dk-have! (list 'FORSOME 'tn_ (list 'IN 'tn_ tt))
                    (lambda () (ew ev)
                               (for-each (lambda (n) (dk-focus! n) (ass)) (dk-opened (lambda () (sep-mi))))))
                  (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'SUBSET tt 'NN) (list 'FORSOME 'tn_ (list 'IN 'tn_ tt)))
                            (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
                  (fact 'nn-least-element tt)
                  (let* ((ex (dk-pick (lambda (f) (and (eq? (car f) 'FORSOME) (dk-contains? f '<=)))
                                      "the least element"))
                         (mv (dk-skolem! ex))
                         (mint (list 'IN mv tt)))
                    (dk-split-all!)
                    (let ((minf (dk-pick (lambda (f) (and (eq? (car f) 'FORALL) (dk-contains? f '<=)
                                                          (dk-contains? f mv)))
                                         "minimality")))
                      (dk-project! (list 'IN mv 'NN) (lambda () (sep-me mint)))
                      (dk-project! (list 'IN w (list fv mv)) (lambda () (sep-me mint)))
                      (for-each
                        (lambda (n)
                          (dk-focus! n)
                          (if (equal? (dk-goal) (list 'IN mv 'NN))
                              (ass)
                              (begin
                                (dk-lam-b!)
                                (mac 'complement-in-membership)
                                (dk-conj-close!
                                  (lambda ()
                                    (if (eq? (car (dk-goal)) 'NOT)
                                        (let* ((pos (dk-landed-1 (lambda () (di))))
                                               (r2 (mlw-bu-open! w (mlw-useg fv mv)))
                                               (jv (cadr (car r2))))
                                          (dk-fact! 'ord-segment-nn-subset mv jv)
                                          (dk-have! (list 'IN jv tt)
                                            (lambda () (for-each (lambda (n2) (dk-focus! n2) (ass))
                                                                 (dk-opened (lambda () (sep-mi))))))
                                          (inst+ minf jv)
                                          (let ((iff (dk-fact! 'seg-mem-lt mv jv)))
                                            (ai iff)
                                            (detach! (list 'IMPLIES (cadr iff) (caddr iff))))
                                          (mlw-nn-clash! jv mv))
                                        (ass)))))))
                        (dk-opened (lambda () (bu-mi mv)))))))))
          (dk-opened (lambda () (di)))))))
  (fact 'class-extensionality lhs rhs)
  (ass))
(qed 'disjointify-union)
(topic! 'disjointify-union 'set-quotient)

;;; (IN (VNB-LAMBDA n_ NN (mu (g n_))) (FUN NN RR-POS-STAR)), g in FUN(NN, cA)
(define (mlw-mu-seq g) (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'n_ 'NN (list 'mu (list g 'n_))))
(define (mlw-mu-seq-type! g)
  (dk-have! (list 'IN (mlw-mu-seq g) '(FUN NN RR-POS-STAR))
    (lambda ()
      (dk-lam-t!)
      (dk-peel!)
      (let ((kv (cadr (cadr (cadr (dk-goal))))))
        (dk-fact! 'fun-apply-type-c g 'NN 'cA kv)
        (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR (list g kv))
        (ass)))))

;;; B_k in cA and B_k subset f(k)
(define (mlw-bterm-facts! fv kv)
  (let ((bt (mlw-bterm fv kv)))
    (fact 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN 'cA kv)
    (fact 'sigma-algebra-seg-union-in kv 'omega 'cA fv)
    (fact 'sigma-algebra-difference-closed 'omega 'cA (list fv kv) (mlw-useg fv kv))
    (dk-have! (list 'SUBSET bt (list fv kv))
      (lambda ()
        (mac 'subset-def)
        (let ((zv (dk-di-var!)))
          (mac-h 'complement-in-membership (list 'IN zv bt))
          (dk-split-all!)
          (ass))))
    bt))

;;; measure-countably-subadditive -- statement copied from
;;; structure-library/measure.scm (the support).
(sp (make-wff (forall-guarded '(omega cA mu f_)
                  '((IS-MEASURE omega cA mu)
                    (IN f_ (FUN NN cA)))
    '(<= (mu (BIG-UNION n_ NN (f_ n_)))
         (ESUM (VNB-LAMBDA n_ NN (mu (f_ n_))))))))
(dk-peel!)
(let* ((parts (mlw-measure-parts! 'omega 'cA 'mu))
       (cadd (cadddr parts))
       (fv 'f_)
       (b (mlw-dsj fv))
       (buf '(BIG-UNION n_ NN (f_ n_)))
       (bub (list 'BIG-UNION 'n_ 'NN (list b 'n_))))
  (fact 'disjointify-type 'omega 'cA fv)
  (fact 'disjointify-disjoint fv 'cA)
  (let ((ca (dk-apply! cadd b)))
    (fact 'disjointify-union fv 'cA)
    (subst (list '= buf bub))
    (subst ca)
    (mlw-mu-seq-type! b)
    (mlw-mu-seq-type! fv)
    (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'k (list 'IMPLIES '(IN k NN)
                     (list '<= (list (mlw-mu-seq b) 'k) (list (mlw-mu-seq fv) 'k))))
      (lambda ()
        (let* ((kv (dk-di-var!))
               (bt (mlw-bterm-facts! fv kv)))
          (dk-lam-b!)
          (fact 'measure-monotone 'omega 'cA 'mu bt (list fv kv))
          (ass))))
    (fact 'esum-nn-le-termwise (mlw-mu-seq b) (mlw-mu-seq fv))
    (ass)))
(qed 'measure-countably-subadditive)
(topic! 'measure-countably-subadditive 'inequalities)

;;; disjointify-prefix: the n-th prefix sum of mu(B_k) is mu(A_0 u ... u A_{n-1}).
(sp (make-wff '(FORALL n (IMPLIES (IN n NN)
   (FORALL omega (FORALL cA (FORALL mu (FORALL f
     (IMPLIES (IS-MEASURE omega cA mu)
       (IMPLIES (IN f (FUN NN cA))
         (= (FINSUM RR-POS-STAR-ADD-MONOID
              (VNB-LAMBDA n_ NN
                (mu ((VNB-LAMBDA bk_ NN (COMPLEMENT-IN (f bk_) (BIG-UNION uj_ (ORD-SEGMENT bk_) (f uj_)))) n_)))
              (ORD-SEGMENT n))
            (mu (BIG-UNION uj_ (ORD-SEGMENT n) (f uj_))))))))))))))
(for-each
  (lambda (l)
    (dk-focus! l)
    (if (mlw-base-leaf? l)
        (begin
          (dk-peel!)
          (let* ((gl (dk-goal)) (ps (cadr gl)) (ms (caddr ps))
                 (u0 (cadr (caddr gl))) (fv (car (cadddr u0)))
                 (parts (mlw-measure-parts! 'omega 'cA 'mu)))
            (fact 'rps-prefix-zero ms)
            (fact 'bu-seg-zero fv)
            (subst (list '= ps 0))
            (subst (list '= u0 'EMPTY-SET))
            (fact 'equality-symmetry '(mu EMPTY-SET) 0)
            (ass)))
        (let* ((r (mlw-step-open!)) (nv (car r)) (ih (cadr r))
               (gl (dk-goal)) (ps (cadr gl)) (ms (caddr ps))
               (usn (cadr (caddr gl))) (fv (car (cadddr usn)))
               (parts (mlw-measure-parts! 'omega 'cA 'mu))
               (b (mlw-dsj fv))
               (un (mlw-useg fv nv))
               (bn (mlw-bterm fv nv))
               (pn (mlw-fs ms (mlw-seg nv))))
          (fact 'disjointify-type 'omega 'cA fv)
          (mlw-mu-seq-type! b)
          (fact 'rps-prefix-succ ms nv)
          (dk-apply! ih 'omega 'cA 'mu fv)
          (mlw-bterm-facts! fv nv)
          (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR bn)
          (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR un)
          (dk-have! (list '= (list ms nv) (list 'mu bn))
                    (lambda () (dk-lam-b!) (rfl)))
          (fact 'bu-seg-succ nv 'cA fv)
          (fact 'union-as-disjoint un (list fv nv))
          (fact 'intersection-complement-in-empty un (list fv nv))
          (fact 'measure-finitely-additive 'omega 'cA 'mu un bn)
          (subst (list '= ps (list 'eplus pn (list ms nv))))
          (subst (list '= pn (list 'mu un)))
          (subst (list '= (list ms nv) (list 'mu bn)))
          (subst (list '= usn (list 'UNION un (list fv nv))))
          (subst (list '= (list 'UNION un (list fv nv)) (list 'UNION un bn)))
          (subst (list '= (list 'mu (list 'UNION un bn)) (list 'eplus (list 'mu un) (list 'mu bn))))
          (mlw-eplus-typed! (list 'mu un) (list 'mu bn))
          (rfl))))
  (dk-opened (lambda () (ni))))
(qed 'disjointify-prefix)
(topic! 'disjointify-prefix 'set-quotient)

;;; nondecreasing-seg-subset: for a nondecreasing sequence of sets, every
;;; term with index below n lies inside the n-th.  Induction on n.
(sp (make-wff '(FORALL n (IMPLIES (IN n NN)
   (FORALL C (FORALL f (IMPLIES (IN f (FUN NN C))
     (IMPLIES (FORALL n_ (IMPLIES (IN n_ NN) (SUBSET (f n_) (f (succ n_)))))
       (FORALL j (IMPLIES (IN j (ORD-SEGMENT n)) (SUBSET (f j) (f n))))))))))))
(for-each
  (lambda (l)
    (dk-focus! l)
    (if (mlw-base-leaf? l)
        (begin
          (dk-peel!)
          (let ((jv (cadr (cadr (dk-goal)))))
            (fact 'ord-segment-zero-no-members jv)
            (ai (list 'NOT (list 'IN jv '(ORD-SEGMENT 0))))))
        (let* ((r (mlw-step-open!)) (nv (car r)) (ih (cadr r))
               (gl (dk-goal)) (fv (car (cadr gl))) (jv (cadr (cadr gl)))
               (inc (dk-pick (lambda (f) (and (eq? (car f) 'FORALL) (dk-contains? f 'succ)
                                              (dk-contains? f 'SUBSET)))
                             "nondecreasing"))
               (orf (mlw-seg-succ-fwd! nv jv)))
          (dk-apply! inc nv)
          (for-each
            (lambda (m)
              (dk-focus! m)
              (if (dk-asm? (list '= jv nv))
                  (begin (subst (list '= jv nv)) (ass))
                  (begin
                    (dk-apply! ih (caddr (caddr (dk-pick (lambda (f) (and (eq? (car f) 'IN) (eq? (cadr f) fv)
                                                                          (pair? (caddr f)) (eq? (car (caddr f)) 'FUN)))
                                                        "f typing")))
                               fv jv)
                    (let ((cv (caddr (caddr (dk-pick (lambda (f) (and (eq? (car f) 'IN) (eq? (cadr f) fv)
                                                                      (pair? (caddr f)) (eq? (car (caddr f)) 'FUN)))
                                                    "f typing")))))
                      (fact 'nn-succ-closed nv)
                      (dk-cite! 'ord-segment-nn-subset nv jv)
                      (fact 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN cv jv)
                      (fact 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN cv nv)
                      (fact 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN cv (list 'succ nv)))
                    (fact 'subset-trans (list fv jv) (list fv nv) (list fv (list 'succ nv)))
                    (ass))))
            (dk-opened (lambda () (ai orf)))))))
  (dk-opened (lambda () (ni))))
(qed 'nondecreasing-seg-subset)
(topic! 'nondecreasing-seg-subset 'set-quotient)

;;; t = phi(k) is a member of IMAGE(phi, NN), phi = n |-> mu(f(n)), with
;;; (IN t RR-POS-STAR) and (IN k NN) in context.
(define (mlw-in-image! phi kv tm)
  (let* ((iff (dk-fact! 'image-membership-iff phi 'NN tm))
         (lhs (cadr iff)) (rhs (caddr iff)))
    (dk-have! rhs
      (lambda ()
        (dk-conj-close!
          (lambda ()
            (let ((g (dk-goal)))
              (cond ((equal? g (list 'IN tm 'SET))
                     (fact 'membership-implies-sethood tm 'RR-POS-STAR) (ass))
                    ((eq? (car g) 'FORSOME)
                     (ew kv)
                     (dk-conj-close!
                       (lambda ()
                         (if (equal? (dk-goal) (list 'IN kv 'NN)) (ass)
                             (begin (dk-lam-b!) (rfl))))))
                    (#t (ass))))))))
    (ai iff)
    (detach! (list 'IMPLIES rhs lhs))))

;;; measure-continuity-from-below -- statement copied from
;;; structure-library/measure.scm (the support).  Thayer Prop. 1.17.
(sp (make-wff (forall-guarded '(omega cA mu f_)
                  (list '(IS-MEASURE omega cA mu)
                        '(IN f_ (FUN NN cA))
                        (forall-guarded '(n_) '((IN n_ NN))
                          '(SUBSET (f_ n_) (f_ (succ n_)))))
    '(= (mu (BIG-UNION n_ NN (f_ n_)))
        (ESUP (IMAGE (VNB-LAMBDA n_ NN (mu (f_ n_))) NN))))))
(dk-peel!)
(let* ((parts (mlw-measure-parts! 'omega 'cA 'mu))
       (cadd (cadddr parts))
       (fv 'f_)
       (phi (mlw-mu-seq fv))
       (img (list 'IMAGE phi 'NN))
       (sv (list 'ESUP img))
       (buf '(BIG-UNION n_ NN (f_ n_)))
       (mbuf (list 'mu buf))
       (b (mlw-dsj fv))
       (bub (list 'BIG-UNION 'n_ 'NN (list b 'n_)))
       (mub (mlw-mu-seq b)))
  (fact 'sigma-algebra-union-closed 'omega 'cA fv)
  (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR buf)
  (mlw-mu-seq-type! fv)
  (dk-have! (list 'SUBSET img 'RR-POS-STAR)
    (lambda ()
      (mac 'subset-def)
      (let ((wv (dk-di-var!)))
        (fact 'image-subset-codomain 'NN 'RR-POS-STAR phi wv)
        (ass))))
  (fact 'esup-in img)
  (fact 'esup-upper img)
  ;; (i) mu(U A_n) <= sup
  (fact 'disjointify-type 'omega 'cA fv)
  (fact 'disjointify-disjoint fv 'cA)
  (let ((ca (dk-apply! cadd b)))
    (fact 'disjointify-union fv 'cA)
    (mlw-mu-seq-type! b)
    (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'n (list 'IMPLIES '(IN n NN) (list '<= (mlw-fs mub '(ORD-SEGMENT n)) sv)))
      (lambda ()
        (let* ((nv (dk-di-var!))
               (un (mlw-useg fv nv))
               (fn (list fv nv))
               (pn (mlw-fs mub (mlw-seg nv))))
          (fact 'disjointify-prefix nv 'omega 'cA 'mu fv)
          (fact 'sigma-algebra-seg-union-in nv 'omega 'cA fv)
          (fact 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN 'cA nv)
          (dk-have! (list 'SUBSET un fn)
            (lambda ()
              (mac 'subset-def)
              (let* ((wv (dk-di-var!))
                     (r (mlw-bu-open! wv un)) (jv (cadr (car r)))
                     (chain (dk-fact! 'nondecreasing-seg-subset nv 'cA fv)))
                (dk-apply! chain jv)
                (fact 'subset-mem-fwd (list fv jv) fn wv)
                (ass))))
          (fact 'measure-monotone 'omega 'cA 'mu un fn)
          (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR un)
          (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR fn)
          (fact 'rps-prefix-type mub nv)
          (mlw-in-image! phi nv (list 'mu fn))
          (inst+ (dk-pick (lambda (f) (and (eq? (car f) 'FORALL) (dk-contains? f img)
                                           (dk-contains? f sv)))
                          "esup-upper")
                 (list 'mu fn))
          (subst (list '= pn (list 'mu un)))
          (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'IN (list 'mu un) 'RR-POS-STAR)
                          (list 'AND (list 'IN (list 'mu fn) 'RR-POS-STAR) (list 'IN sv 'RR-POS-STAR)))
                    (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
          (dk-have! (list 'AND (list '<= (list 'mu un) (list 'mu fn)) (list '<= (list 'mu fn) sv))
                    (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
          (fact 'rr-pos-star-le-trans (list 'mu un) (list 'mu fn) sv)
          (ass))))
    (fact 'esum-nn-le-of-prefixes mub sv)
    (dk-have! (list '<= mbuf sv)
      (lambda ()
        (subst (list '= buf bub))
        (subst ca)
        (ass))))
  ;; (ii) sup <= mu(U A_n)
  (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'x (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'x img) (list '<= 'x mbuf)))
    (lambda ()
      (let* ((xv (dk-di-var!))
             (iff (dk-fact! 'image-membership-iff phi 'NN xv)))
        (ai iff)
        (let ((conj (detach! (list 'IMPLIES (cadr iff) (caddr iff)))))
          (dk-split-all! (list (dk-ctx-form (caddr iff))))
          (let* ((ex (dk-pick (dk-head? 'FORSOME) "the preimage index"))
                 (yv (dk-skolem! ex))
                 (fy (list fv yv)))
            (dk-split-all!)
            (subst (list '= xv (list phi yv)))
            (dk-lam-b!)
            (fact 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN 'cA yv)
            (dk-have! (list 'SUBSET fy buf)
              (lambda ()
                (mac 'subset-def)
                (let ((wv (dk-di-var!)))
                  (for-each (lambda (n) (dk-focus! n) (ass)) (dk-opened (lambda () (bu-mi yv)))))))
            (fact 'measure-monotone 'omega 'cA 'mu fy buf)
            (ass))))))
  (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'IN mbuf 'RR-POS-STAR)
                  (list 'FORALL 'x (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'x img) (list '<= 'x mbuf))))
            (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
  (fact 'esup-least img mbuf)
  ;; (iii) antisymmetry
  (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'IN mbuf 'RR-POS-STAR) (list 'IN sv 'RR-POS-STAR))
            (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
  (dk-have! (list 'AND (list '<= mbuf sv) (list '<= sv mbuf))
            (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
  (fact 'rr-pos-star-le-antisymm mbuf sv)
  (ass))
(qed 'measure-continuity-from-below)
(topic! 'measure-continuity-from-below 'analysis)

;;; measure-finite-subset: below a set of finite measure, measures are finite.
(sp (make-wff (forall-guarded '(omega cA mu a_ b_)
                  '((IS-MEASURE omega cA mu) (IN a_ cA) (IN b_ cA) (SUBSET a_ b_) (IN (mu b_) RR))
    '(IN (mu a_) RR))))
(dk-peel!)
(let ((parts (mlw-measure-parts! 'omega 'cA 'mu)))
  (fact 'measure-monotone 'omega 'cA 'mu 'a_ 'b_)
  (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR 'a_)
  (dk-have! '(AND (IN (mu a_) RR-POS-STAR) (IN (mu b_) RR))
            (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
  (fact 'rr-pos-star-le-real-in-rr '(mu a_) '(mu b_))
  (ass))
(qed 'measure-finite-subset)
(topic! 'measure-finite-subset 'inequalities)

;;; measure-subtractive: a subset b, mu(b) finite  =>  mu(b \ a) = mu(b) - mu(a).
;;; (The notes use it unnumbered in the proof of Prop. 1.18.)
(sp (make-wff (forall-guarded '(omega cA mu a_ b_)
                  '((IS-MEASURE omega cA mu) (IN a_ cA) (IN b_ cA) (SUBSET a_ b_) (IN (mu b_) RR))
    '(= (mu (COMPLEMENT-IN b_ a_)) (- (mu b_) (mu a_))))))
(dk-peel!)
(let* ((parts (mlw-measure-parts! 'omega 'cA 'mu))
       (dv '(COMPLEMENT-IN b_ a_))
       (ud (list 'UNION 'a_ dv))
       (ma '(mu a_)) (mb '(mu b_)) (md (list 'mu dv)))
  (fact 'sigma-algebra-difference-closed 'omega 'cA 'b_ 'a_)
  (fact 'union-complement-in 'a_ 'b_)
  (fact 'intersection-complement-in-empty 'a_ 'b_)
  (fact 'measure-finitely-additive 'omega 'cA 'mu 'a_ dv)
  (dk-have! '(SUBSET (COMPLEMENT-IN b_ a_) b_)
    (lambda () (fact 'complement-in-subset 'a_ 'b_) (ass)))
  (fact 'measure-finite-subset 'omega 'cA 'mu 'a_ 'b_)
  (fact 'measure-finite-subset 'omega 'cA 'mu dv 'b_)
  (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR 'a_)
  (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR dv)
  (fact 'rr-pos-star-nonneg ma)
  (fact 'rr-pos-star-nonneg md)
  (fact 'eplus-real-defined ma md)
  (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR 'b_)
  (dk-congr! (list '= 'b_ ud) (lambda (t) (list 'mu t)))
  (dk-have! (list '= mb (list '+ ma md))
    (lambda ()
      (subst (list '= mb (list 'mu ud)))
      (subst (list '= (list 'mu ud) (list 'eplus ma md)))
      (subst (list '= (list 'eplus ma md) (list 'binplus ma md)))
      (mac 'binplus-apply)
      (rfl)))
  (dk-ineq! (list 'IN ma 'RR) (list 'IN md 'RR) (list 'IN mb 'RR) (list '= mb (list '+ ma md))))
(qed 'measure-subtractive)
(topic! 'measure-subtractive 'analysis)


;;; (IN (COMPLEMENT-IN (f_ 0) (f_ k)) cA) and its sethood: what beta on C owes
(define (mlw-cn-set! kv)
  (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'f_ 'NN 'cA kv)
  (fact 'sigma-algebra-difference-closed 'omega 'cA '(f_ 0) (list 'f_ kv))
  (fact 'membership-implies-sethood (list 'COMPLEMENT-IN '(f_ 0) (list 'f_ kv)) 'cA))

;;; measure-continuity-from-above -- statement copied from
;;; structure-library/measure.scm (the support).  Thayer Prop. 1.18, by the
;;; notes' route: C_n = A_0 \ A_n is nondecreasing with union A_0 \ I, so
;;; mu(A_0) - mu(I) = sup_n (mu(A_0) - mu(A_n)), all terms finite.  The sup is
;;; not manipulated: the two inequalities of inf are proven separately.
(sp (make-wff (forall-guarded '(omega cA mu f_)
                  (list '(IS-MEASURE omega cA mu)
                        '(IN f_ (FUN NN cA))
                        (forall-guarded '(n_) '((IN n_ NN))
                          '(SUBSET (f_ (succ n_)) (f_ n_)))
                        '(IN (mu (f_ 0)) RR))
    '(= (mu (COMPLEMENT-IN omega (BIG-UNION n_ NN (COMPLEMENT-IN omega (f_ n_)))))
        (EINF (IMAGE (VNB-LAMBDA n_ NN (mu (f_ n_))) NN))))))
(dk-peel!)
(let* ((parts (mlw-measure-parts! 'omega 'cA 'mu))
       (sig (car parts))
       (fv 'f_)
       (a0 '(f_ 0))
       (cv '(mu (f_ 0)))
       (buc '(BIG-UNION n_ NN (COMPLEMENT-IN omega (f_ n_))))
       (iv (list 'COMPLEMENT-IN 'omega buc))
       (miv (list 'mu iv))
       (phi (mlw-mu-seq fv))
       (img (list 'IMAGE phi 'NN))
       (ev (list 'EINF img))
       (cfam '(VNB-LAMBDA cn_ NN (COMPLEMENT-IN (f_ 0) (f_ cn_))))
       (dec (dk-pick (lambda (f) (and (eq? (car f) 'FORALL) (dk-contains? f 'succ)
                                      (dk-contains? f 'SUBSET)))
                     "nonincreasing"))
       (dv (list '- cv ev)))
  (fact 'nn-zero-in)
  (fact 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN 'cA 0)
  (dk-project! '(SUBSET cA (POWER omega)) 'IS-SIGMA-ALGEBRA sig)
  ;; (1) I is measurable
  (dk-have! '(IN (VNB-LAMBDA n_ NN (COMPLEMENT-IN omega (f_ n_))) (FUN NN cA))
    (lambda ()
      (dk-lam-t!)
      (dk-peel!)
      (let ((kv (cadr (caddr (cadr (dk-goal))))))
        (fact 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN 'cA kv)
        (fact 'sigma-algebra-complement-closed 'omega 'cA (list fv kv))
        (ass))))
  (let* ((cf '(VNB-LAMBDA n_ NN (COMPLEMENT-IN omega (f_ n_))))
         (bul (list 'BIG-UNION 'n_ 'NN (list cf 'n_))))
    (fact 'sigma-algebra-union-closed 'omega 'cA cf)
    ;; the union of the redexes is the union of the reduced terms (beta is not
    ;; licensed under the BIG-UNION binder, so this goes by extensionality)
    (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'w_ (list 'IFF (list 'IN 'w_ bul) (list 'IN 'w_ buc)))
      (lambda ()
        (let ((wv (dk-di-var! (lambda (g) (cadr (cadr g))))))
          (for-each
            (lambda (l)
              (dk-focus! l)
              (if (equal? (dk-goal) (list 'IN wv buc))
                  (let* ((r (mlw-bu-open! wv bul)) (e (cadr (car r))))
                    (fact 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN 'cA e)
                    (fact 'sigma-algebra-complement-closed 'omega 'cA (list fv e))
                    (fact 'membership-implies-sethood (list 'COMPLEMENT-IN 'omega (list fv e)) 'cA)
                    (dk-lam-b-h! (cdr r))
                    (for-each (lambda (n) (dk-focus! n) (ass)) (dk-opened (lambda () (bu-mi e)))))
                  (let* ((r (mlw-bu-open! wv buc)) (e (cadr (car r))))
                    (fact 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN 'cA e)
                    (fact 'sigma-algebra-complement-closed 'omega 'cA (list fv e))
                    (fact 'membership-implies-sethood (list 'COMPLEMENT-IN 'omega (list fv e)) 'cA)
                    (for-each (lambda (n) (dk-focus! n)
                                (if (equal? (dk-goal) (list 'IN e 'NN)) (ass)
                                    (begin (dk-lam-b!) (ass))))
                              (dk-opened (lambda () (bu-mi e)))))))
            (dk-opened (lambda () (di)))))))
    (fact 'class-extensionality bul buc)
    (dk-have! (list 'IN buc 'cA)
              (lambda () (subst (list '= buc bul)) (ass))))
  (fact 'sigma-algebra-complement-closed 'omega 'cA buc)
  ;; (2) I is inside every A_k
  (let ((isub (list 'FORALL 'k (list 'IMPLIES '(IN k NN) (list 'SUBSET iv '(f_ k))))))
    (dk-have! isub
      (lambda ()
        (let ((kv (dk-di-var!)))
          (mac 'subset-def)
          (let* ((wv (dk-di-var!))
                 (wfk (list 'IN wv (list fv kv))))
            (dk-project! (list 'IN wv 'omega)
                         (lambda () (mac-h 'complement-in-membership (list 'IN wv iv))))
            (dk-project! (list 'NOT (list 'IN wv buc))
                         (lambda () (mac-h 'complement-in-membership (list 'IN wv iv))))
            (use-em wfk
              dk-ass!
              (lambda ()
                (dk-have! (list 'IN wv buc)
                  (lambda ()
                    (for-each (lambda (n)
                                (dk-focus! n)
                                (if (equal? (dk-goal) (list 'IN kv 'NN))
                                    (ass)
                                    (begin (mac 'complement-in-membership)
                                           (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!))))
                              (dk-opened (lambda () (bu-mi kv))))))
                (ai (list 'NOT (list 'IN wv buc)))))))))
    ;; A_k inside A_0
    (let ((chain (dk-fact! 'nn-nested-subset-chain fv)))
      (define (sub0! kv)
        (fact 'nn-zero-le kv)
        (dk-apply! chain 0 kv))
      (inst+ isub 0)
      (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR iv)
      (fact 'measure-finite-subset 'omega 'cA 'mu iv a0)
      ;; (3) C_n = A_0 \ A_n: measurable, nondecreasing, union A_0 \ I
      (dk-have! (list 'IN cfam '(FUN NN cA))
        (lambda ()
          (dk-lam-t!)
          (dk-peel!)
          (let ((kv (cadr (caddr (cadr (dk-goal))))))
            (fact 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN 'cA kv)
            (fact 'sigma-algebra-difference-closed 'omega 'cA a0 (list fv kv))
            (ass))))
      (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'n_ (list 'IMPLIES '(IN n_ NN)
                       (list 'SUBSET (list cfam 'n_) (list cfam '(succ n_)))))
        (lambda ()
          (let* ((nv (dk-di-var!)) (sn (list 'succ nv)))
            (fact 'nn-succ-closed nv)
            (mlw-cn-set! nv)
            (mlw-cn-set! sn)
            (dk-lam-b!)
            (dk-apply! dec nv)
            (mac 'subset-def)
            (let* ((wv (dk-di-var!))
                   (h1 (list 'IN wv (list 'COMPLEMENT-IN a0 (list fv nv)))))
              (fact 'subset-mem-fwd (list fv sn) (list fv nv) wv)
              (mac-h 'complement-in-membership h1)
              (dk-split-all!)
              (mac 'complement-in-membership)
              (dk-only! (list 'IN wv a0) (list 'NOT (list 'IN wv (list fv nv)))
                        (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN wv (list fv sn)) (list 'IN wv (list fv nv))))
              (prop)))))
      (let* ((cb (dk-fact! 'measure-continuity-from-below 'omega 'cA 'mu cfam))
             (bu-cc (cadr (cadr cb)))
             (phiC (mlw-mu-seq cfam))
             (imgC (list 'IMAGE phiC 'NN))
             (a0i (list 'COMPLEMENT-IN a0 iv)))
        (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'w_ (list 'IFF (list 'IN 'w_ bu-cc) (list 'IN 'w_ a0i)))
          (lambda ()
            (let ((wv (dk-di-var! (lambda (g) (cadr (cadr g))))))
              (for-each
                (lambda (l)
                  (dk-focus! l)
                  (if (equal? (dk-goal) (list 'IN wv a0i))
                      (let* ((r (mlw-bu-open! wv bu-cc)) (e (cadr (car r))))
                        (mlw-cn-set! e)
                        (dk-lam-b-h! (cdr r))
                        (mac-h 'complement-in-membership (list 'IN wv (list 'COMPLEMENT-IN a0 (list fv e))))
                        (dk-split-all!)
                        (mac 'complement-in-membership)
                        (dk-conj-close!
                          (lambda ()
                            (if (eq? (car (dk-goal)) 'NOT)
                                (begin
                                  (di)
                                  (inst+ isub e)
                                  (fact 'subset-mem-fwd iv (list fv e) wv)
                                  (ai (list 'NOT (list 'IN wv (list fv e)))))
                                (ass)))))
                      (begin
                        (mac-h 'complement-in-membership (list 'IN wv a0i))
                        (dk-split-all!)
                        (fact 'subset-mem-fwd 'cA '(POWER omega) a0)
                        (fact 'power-mem-in 'omega a0 wv)
                        (use-em (list 'IN wv buc)
                          (lambda ()
                            (let* ((r (mlw-bu-open! wv buc)) (e (cadr (car r))))
                              (mac-h 'complement-in-membership (cdr r))
                              (dk-split-all!)
                              (mlw-cn-set! e)
                              (for-each
                                (lambda (n)
                                  (dk-focus! n)
                                  (if (equal? (dk-goal) (list 'IN e 'NN))
                                      (ass)
                                      (begin (dk-lam-b!)
                                             (mac 'complement-in-membership)
                                             (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!))))
                                (dk-opened (lambda () (bu-mi e))))))
                          (lambda ()
                            (dk-have! (list 'IN wv iv)
                              (lambda () (mac 'complement-in-membership)
                                         (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
                            (ai (list 'NOT (list 'IN wv iv))))))))
                (dk-opened (lambda () (di)))))))
        (fact 'class-extensionality bu-cc a0i)
        ;; (4) arithmetic: e = inf is real, d = mu(A_0) - e is a bound for the C-sup
        (mlw-mu-seq-type! fv)
        (mlw-mu-seq-type! cfam)
        (dk-have! (list 'SUBSET img 'RR-POS-STAR)
          (lambda () (mac 'subset-def)
                     (let ((wv (dk-di-var!)))
                       (fact 'image-subset-codomain 'NN 'RR-POS-STAR phi wv) (ass))))
        (dk-have! (list 'SUBSET imgC 'RR-POS-STAR)
          (lambda () (mac 'subset-def)
                     (let ((wv (dk-di-var!)))
                       (fact 'image-subset-codomain 'NN 'RR-POS-STAR phiC wv) (ass))))
        (fact 'einf-in img)
        (let ((low (dk-fact! 'einf-lower img)))
          (define (e-below! kv)     ; (<= e (mu (f k))), with (mu (f k)) typed
            (fact 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN 'cA kv)
            (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR (list fv kv))
            (mlw-in-image! phi kv (list 'mu (list fv kv)))
            (inst+ low (list 'mu (list fv kv))))
          (e-below! 0)
          (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'IN ev 'RR-POS-STAR) (list 'IN cv 'RR))
                    (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
          (fact 'rr-pos-star-le-real-in-rr ev cv)
          (fact 'rr-pos-star-nonneg ev)
          (fact 'rr-sub-in-rr cv ev)
          (dk-have! (list '<= 0 dv)
                    (lambda () (dk-ineq! (list 'IN cv 'RR) (list 'IN ev 'RR) (list '<= ev cv))))
          (dk-have! (list 'IN dv 'RR-POS-STAR)
            (lambda ()
              (let ((iff (dk-fact! 'rr-pos-star-membership dv)))
                (dk-have! (caddr iff) (lambda () (oi-l) (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
                (ai iff)
                (detach! (list 'IMPLIES (caddr iff) (cadr iff)))
                (ass))))
          (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'x (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'x imgC) (list '<= 'x dv)))
            (lambda ()
              (let* ((xv (dk-di-var!))
                     (iff (dk-fact! 'image-membership-iff phiC 'NN xv)))
                (ai iff)
                (detach! (list 'IMPLIES (cadr iff) (caddr iff)))
                (dk-split-all! (list (dk-ctx-form (caddr iff))))
                (let* ((ex (dk-pick (dk-head? 'FORSOME) "the index"))
                       (yv (dk-skolem! ex))
                       (fy (list fv yv))
                       (my (list 'mu fy))
                       (cy (list 'COMPLEMENT-IN a0 fy)))
                  (dk-split-all!)
                  (subst (list '= xv (list phiC yv)))
                  (mlw-cn-set! yv)
                  (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR (list 'COMPLEMENT-IN a0 fy))
                  (dk-lam-b!)
                  (e-below! yv)
                  (sub0! yv)
                  (fact 'measure-subtractive 'omega 'cA 'mu fy a0)
                  (fact 'measure-finite-subset 'omega 'cA 'mu fy a0)
                  (subst (list '= (list 'mu cy) (list '- cv my)))
                  (dk-ineq! (list 'IN cv 'RR) (list 'IN ev 'RR) (list 'IN my 'RR)
                            (list '<= ev my))))))
          (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'IN dv 'RR-POS-STAR)
                          (list 'FORALL 'x (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'x imgC) (list '<= 'x dv))))
                    (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
          (fact 'esup-least imgC dv)
          ;; mu(A_0 \ I) <= d, and mu(A_0 \ I) = mu(A_0) - mu(I)
          (fact 'sigma-algebra-difference-closed 'omega 'cA a0 iv)
          (fact 'measure-subtractive 'omega 'cA 'mu iv a0)
          (dk-have! '(SUBSET (COMPLEMENT-IN (f_ 0) (COMPLEMENT-IN omega (BIG-UNION n_ NN (COMPLEMENT-IN omega (f_ n_))))) (f_ 0))
            (lambda () (fact 'complement-in-subset iv a0) (ass)))
          (fact 'measure-finite-subset 'omega 'cA 'mu a0i a0)
          (dk-have! (list '<= (list 'mu a0i) dv)
            (lambda ()
              (subst (list '= a0i bu-cc))
              (subst cb)
              (ass)))
          (dk-have! (list '<= ev miv)
            (lambda ()
              (dk-ineq! (list 'IN cv 'RR) (list 'IN ev 'RR) (list 'IN miv 'RR)
                        (list 'IN (list 'mu a0i) 'RR)
                        (list '= (list 'mu a0i) (list '- cv miv))
                        (list '<= (list 'mu a0i) dv))))
          ;; (5) mu(I) <= every mu(A_k), so mu(I) <= e
          (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'x (list 'IMPLIES (list 'IN 'x img) (list '<= miv 'x)))
            (lambda ()
              (let* ((xv (dk-di-var!))
                     (iff (dk-fact! 'image-membership-iff phi 'NN xv)))
                (ai iff)
                (detach! (list 'IMPLIES (cadr iff) (caddr iff)))
                (dk-split-all! (list (dk-ctx-form (caddr iff))))
                (let* ((ex (dk-pick (dk-head? 'FORSOME) "the index"))
                       (yv (dk-skolem! ex))
                       (fy (list fv yv)))
                  (dk-split-all!)
                  (subst (list '= xv (list phi yv)))
                  (dk-lam-b!)
                  (fact 'fun-apply-type-c fv 'NN 'cA yv)
                  (inst+ isub yv)
                  (fact 'measure-monotone 'omega 'cA 'mu iv fy)
                  (ass)))))
          (fact 'einf-greatest img miv)
          ;; (6) antisymmetry
          (dk-have! (list 'AND (list 'IN miv 'RR-POS-STAR) (list 'IN ev 'RR-POS-STAR))
                    (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
          (dk-have! (list 'AND (list '<= miv ev) (list '<= ev miv))
                    (lambda () (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
          (fact 'rr-pos-star-le-antisymm miv ev)
          (ass))))))
(qed 'measure-continuity-from-above)
(topic! 'measure-continuity-from-above 'analysis)

;;; =====================================================================
;;; (D) Mapping properties: the push-forward of a measure.  Thayer Prop. 1.19.
;;; =====================================================================

;;; the preimage of b under f, the SEP form IS-MEASURABLE-MAP uses
(define (mlw-pre b) (list 'SEP 'x_ 'omega (list 'IN '(f x_) b)))

;;; (IN (pre b) cA) and (IN (pre b) SET), with (IN b cB) in context
(define (mlw-pre-typed! b)
  (fact 'measurable-map-preimage 'omega 'cA 'omega2 'cB 'f b)
  (fact 'membership-implies-sethood (mlw-pre b) 'cA))

(define mlw-nu '(VNB-LAMBDA pb_ cB (mu (SEP x_ omega (IN (f x_) pb_)))))


;;; (= (SEP x_ omega (IN (f x_) EMPTY-SET)) EMPTY-SET), landed
(define (mlw-inter-empty-sep! p0)
  (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'w_ (list 'IFF (list 'IN 'w_ p0) '(IN w_ EMPTY-SET)))
    (lambda ()
      (let ((w (dk-di-var! (lambda (gl) (cadr (cadr gl))))))
        (for-each
          (lambda (l)
            (dk-focus! l)
            (if (equal? (dk-goal) (list 'IN w 'EMPTY-SET))
                (begin
                  (sep-me (list 'IN w p0))
                  (fact 'empty-set-has-no-members (list 'f w))
                  (ai (list 'NOT (list 'IN (list 'f w) 'EMPTY-SET))))
                (begin
                  (fact 'empty-set-has-no-members w)
                  (ai (list 'NOT (list 'IN w 'EMPTY-SET))))))
          (dk-opened (lambda () (di)))))))
  (fact 'class-extensionality p0 'EMPTY-SET))

;;; countable additivity of the push-forward, on the focus leaf
(define (mlw-push-cadd! nu cadd)
  (dk-peel!)
  (let* ((gl (dk-goal))
         (bug (cadr (cadr gl)))
         (gv (car (cadddr bug)))
         (dd (dk-pick (lambda (f) (and (eq? (car f) 'FORALL) (dk-contains? f 'INTERSECTION)
                                       (dk-contains? f gv)))
                      "disjointness of g"))
         (hl (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'hn_ 'NN (list 'SEP 'x_ 'omega (list 'IN '(f x_) (list gv 'hn_)))))
         (buh (list 'BIG-UNION 'n_ 'NN (list hl 'n_)))
         (sepbu (mlw-pre bug))
         (l1 (mlw-mu-seq hl))
         (l2 (list 'VNB-LAMBDA 'n_ 'NN (list nu (list gv 'n_))))
         (gtyped! (lambda (kv)
                    (fact 'fun-apply-type-c gv 'NN 'cB kv)
                    (mlw-pre-typed! (list gv kv)))))
    ;; h = n |-> f^-1(g n) is a sequence in cA
    (dk-have! (list 'IN hl '(FUN NN cA))
      (lambda ()
        (dk-lam-t!)
        (dk-peel!)
        (let ((kv (cadr (caddr (cadddr (cadr (dk-goal)))))))
          (gtyped! kv)
          (ass))))
    ;; ... of pairwise disjoint sets
    (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'i_ (list 'FORALL 'j_
                (list 'IMPLIES '(IN i_ NN) (list 'IMPLIES '(IN j_ NN) (list 'IMPLIES '(NOT (= i_ j_))
                  (list '= (list 'INTERSECTION (list hl 'i_) (list hl 'j_)) 'EMPTY-SET))))))
      (lambda ()
        (dk-peel!)
        (let* ((g2 (dk-goal))
               (iv (cadr (cadr (cadr g2)))) (jv (cadr (caddr (cadr g2))))
               (gi (list gv iv)) (gj (list gv jv))
               (pi_ (mlw-pre gi)) (pj (mlw-pre gj)))
          (gtyped! iv)
          (gtyped! jv)
          (dk-lam-b!)
          (let ((dij (dk-apply! dd iv jv)))
            (mlw-inter-empty! pi_ pj
              (lambda (w)
                (let* ((fw (list 'f w))
                       (ig (list 'INTERSECTION gi gj))
                       (k (list 'NOT (list 'AND (list 'IN w pi_) (list 'IN w pj)))))
                  (dk-have! k
                    (lambda ()
                      (let ((both (dk-landed-1 (lambda () (di)))))
                        (dk-split-all! (list both))
                        (sep-me (list 'IN w pi_))
                        (sep-me (list 'IN w pj))
                        (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'f 'omega 'omega2 w)
                        (dk-have! (list 'IN fw 'EMPTY-SET)
                          (lambda ()
                            (subst (list '= 'EMPTY-SET ig))
                            (mac 'intersection-membership)
                            (dk-conj-close! dk-ass!)))
                        (fact 'empty-set-has-no-members fw)
                        (ai (list 'NOT (list 'IN fw 'EMPTY-SET))))))
                  (list k))))))))
    (let ((ch (dk-apply! cadd hl)))
      ;; f^-1(U g_n) = U f^-1(g_n)
      (fact 'sigma-algebra-union-closed 'omega2 'cB gv)
      (mlw-pre-typed! bug)
      (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'w_ (list 'IFF (list 'IN 'w_ sepbu) (list 'IN 'w_ buh)))
        (lambda ()
          (let ((w (dk-di-var! (lambda (g3) (cadr (cadr g3))))))
            (for-each
              (lambda (l)
                (dk-focus! l)
                (if (equal? (dk-goal) (list 'IN w buh))
                    (begin
                      (sep-me (list 'IN w sepbu))
                      (let* ((r (mlw-bu-open! (list 'f w) bug)) (e (cadr (car r))))
                        (gtyped! e)
                        (for-each (lambda (n)
                                    (dk-focus! n)
                                    (if (equal? (dk-goal) (list 'IN e 'NN)) (ass)
                                        (begin (dk-lam-b!)
                                               (for-each (lambda (m) (dk-focus! m) (ass))
                                                         (dk-opened (lambda () (sep-mi)))))))
                                  (dk-opened (lambda () (bu-mi e))))))
                    (let* ((r (mlw-bu-open! w buh)) (e (cadr (car r))))
                      (gtyped! e)
                      (dk-lam-b-h! (cdr r))
                      (sep-me (list 'IN w (mlw-pre (list gv e))))
                      (for-each (lambda (m)
                                  (dk-focus! m)
                                  (if (equal? (dk-goal) (list 'IN w 'omega)) (ass)
                                      (for-each (lambda (n) (dk-focus! n) (ass))
                                                (dk-opened (lambda () (bu-mi e))))))
                                (dk-opened (lambda () (sep-mi)))))))
              (dk-opened (lambda () (di)))))))
      (fact 'class-extensionality sepbu buh)
      ;; the two summand sequences are the same function
      (mlw-mu-seq-type! hl)
      (dk-have! (list 'IN l2 '(FUN NN RR-POS-STAR))
        (lambda ()
          (dk-lam-t!)
          (dk-peel!)
          (let ((kv (cadr (cadr (cadr (dk-goal))))))
            (fact 'fun-apply-type-c gv 'NN 'cB kv)
            (fact 'fun-apply-type-c nu 'cB 'RR-POS-STAR (list gv kv))
            (ass))))
      (dk-project! (list 'IN l1 '(FUN NN)) 'fun-codomain-iff (list 'IN l1 '(FUN NN RR-POS-STAR)))
      (dk-project! (list 'IN l2 '(FUN NN)) 'fun-codomain-iff (list 'IN l2 '(FUN NN RR-POS-STAR)))
      (dk-have! (list 'FORALL 'x (list 'IMPLIES '(IN x NN) (list '= (list l1 'x) (list l2 'x))))
        (lambda ()
          (let ((xv (dk-di-var!)))
            (gtyped! xv)
            (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR (mlw-pre (list gv xv)))
            (dk-lam-b!)
            (rfl))))
      (fact 'fun-domain-extensionality 'NN l1 l2)
      ;; assemble
      (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR sepbu)
      (dk-have! (list '= (list nu bug) (list 'mu sepbu))
                (lambda () (lam-b) (rfl)))
      (mlw-dom! l2)
      (fact 'esum-in l2)
      (subst (list '= (list nu bug) (list 'mu sepbu)))
      (subst (list '= sepbu buh))
      (subst ch)
      (subst (list '= l1 l2))
      (rfl))))

(sp (make-wff (forall-guarded '(omega cA mu omega2 cB f)
                  '((IS-MEASURE omega cA mu)
                    (IS-MEASURABLE-MAP omega cA omega2 cB f))
    '(IS-MEASURE omega2 cB (VNB-LAMBDA pb_ cB (mu (SEP x_ omega (IN (f x_) pb_))))))))
(dk-peel!)
(let* ((parts (mlw-measure-parts! 'omega 'cA 'mu))
       (m0 (caddr parts)) (cadd (cadddr parts))
       (nu mlw-nu))
  (fact 'measurable-map-target-algebra 'omega 'cA 'omega2 'cB 'f)
  (fact 'measurable-map-in-fun 'omega 'cA 'omega2 'cB 'f)
  (fact 'sigma-algebra-ambient-set 'omega2 'cB)
  (fact 'power-set 'omega2)
  (dk-project! '(SUBSET cB (POWER omega2)) 'IS-SIGMA-ALGEBRA '(IS-SIGMA-ALGEBRA omega2 cB))
  (fact 'subclass-of-set-is-set 'cB '(POWER omega2))
  ;; nu is a function from cB to [0, +inf]
  (dk-have! (list 'IN nu '(FUN cB RR-POS-STAR))
    (lambda ()
      (dk-lam-t!)
      (dk-peel!)
      (let ((bv (caddr (cadddr (cadr (cadr (dk-goal)))))))
        (mlw-pre-typed! bv)
        (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR (mlw-pre bv))
        (ass))))
  (mac 'IS-MEASURE)
  (dk-conj-close!
    (lambda ()
      (let ((g (dk-goal)))
        (cond
          ((eq? (car g) 'IS-SIGMA-ALGEBRA) (ass))
          ((eq? (car g) 'IN) (ass))
          ((eq? (car g) '=)
           ;; nu(empty) = mu(f^-1(empty)) = mu(empty) = 0
           (let ((p0 (mlw-pre 'EMPTY-SET)))
             (fact 'sigma-algebra-empty-in 'omega2 'cB)
             (mlw-pre-typed! 'EMPTY-SET)
             (fact 'fun-apply-type-c 'mu 'cA 'RR-POS-STAR p0)
             (dk-have! (list '= (list nu 'EMPTY-SET) (list 'mu p0))
                       (lambda () (lam-b) (rfl)))
             (mlw-inter-empty-sep! p0)
             (subst (list '= (list nu 'EMPTY-SET) (list 'mu p0)))
             (subst (list '= p0 'EMPTY-SET))
             (ass)))
          (#t (mlw-push-cadd! nu cadd)))))))
(qed 'measure-pushforward)
(topic! 'measure-pushforward 'analysis)

;;; The topics and glosses of the five theorems that stood as supports in structure-library/measure.scm until 2026-10-03 (moved here with their proofs).
(topic!   'measure-monotone 'inequalities)
(gloss!   'measure-monotone
  "A measure is monotone: a subset of a measurable set has no larger measure.
   Rudin Thm. 1.19(c), p. 17.  Thayer states the same fact without a number,
   using it from Chapter 1 onward.")
(topic!   'measure-finitely-additive 'plumbing)
(gloss!   'measure-finitely-additive
  "A measure is additive on two disjoint measurable sets.  Rudin
   Thm. 1.19(b), p. 17, which states the n-term form; VNB states the BINARY
   case, since the n-term form needs a finite family and follows from this one
   by induction.  Both sources derive it from countable additivity by padding
   the sequence with empty sets.")
(topic!   'measure-countably-subadditive 'inequalities)
(gloss!   'measure-countably-subadditive
  "The measure of a countable union is at most the sum of the measures, the
   terms not being assumed disjoint.")
(topic!   'measure-continuity-from-below 'analysis)
(gloss!   'measure-continuity-from-below
  "For a non-decreasing sequence of measurable sets, the measure of the union
   is the supremum of the measures.  Thayer Prop. 1.17 (p. 4), Eq. (7), which
   writes exactly sup_k mu(A_k); Rudin Thm. 1.19(d) (p. 17) writes the same
   fact as mu(A_n) -> mu(A), a LIMIT.  VNB follows Thayer, because the
   supremum is available directly in RR-POS-STAR (ESUP over the image of the sequence)
   whereas a limit in [0,+inf] would first have to be defined.")
(topic!   'measure-continuity-from-above 'analysis)
(gloss!   'measure-continuity-from-above
  "For a non-increasing sequence of measurable sets whose FIRST term has
   finite measure, the measure of the intersection is the infimum of the
   measures.  Thayer Prop. 1.18 (p. 5), Eq. (9), which writes inf_k mu(A_k);
   Rudin Thm. 1.19(e) (p. 17) writes it as a limit.  Two divergences, both
   forced by the kernel and neither mathematical: the countable intersection
   is spelled omega \\ union_n (omega \\ A_n), there being no countable
   intersection binder; and the finiteness hypothesis is placed on the term of
   index 0, the sources indexing their sequences from 1.  The hypothesis is
   not decorative -- Thayer's paragraph before Prop. 1.18 says in as many
   words that the statement fails without it.")
